(156301, 8382, 3859, '<td valign="top">I would imagine it was hard to focus this, but a little sharper focus would give this already colorful and interesting shot a bit more punch.</td>', 'I would imagine it was hard to focus this, but a little sharper focus would give this already colorful and interesting shot a bit more punch.', '2002-11-18 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
