(156356, 8424, 4906, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting was a little dark at the bottom of the picture. Nice subject though.</td>', 'I think the lighting was a little dark at the bottom of the picture. Nice subject though.', '2002-11-18 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156357, 8424, 92, '<td valign="top">Really nicely done.</td>', 'Really nicely done.', '2002-11-18 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156358, 8424, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but a little too dark. I still really like this photo and its subject.</td>', 'Great composition, but a little too dark. I still really like this photo and its subject.', '2002-11-18 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156359, 8424, 2170, '<td valign="top">Great subject for the photo.  What is the explanation for the significant color shift in the upper right corner of the barometer?  It''s distracting, unfortunately.  There is also a very noticeable blue tint to the photo.  It should be possible to clean it up a little more.</td>', 'Great subject for the photo.  What is the explanation for the significant color shift in the upper right corner of the barometer?  It''s distracting, unfortunately.  There is also a very noticeable blue tint to the photo.  It should be possible to clean it up a little more.', '2002-11-18 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156360, 8424, 4832, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, too grainy. Colors too faded.</td>', 'Nice lighting, too grainy. Colors too faded.', '2002-11-18 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156361, 8424, 2343, '<td valign="top">Inhteresting but it''s washed out.  Maybe more contrast with the background and foreground? It''s just plain lost it''s detail.</td>', 'Inhteresting but it''s washed out.  Maybe more contrast with the background and foreground? It''s just plain lost it''s detail.', '2002-11-19 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156362, 8424, 4648, '<td valign="top">If you''re not going with 1/3s crop it evenly.  Beautiful photo.  Very clear of the subject.  Great subject.  The techs are right on.  Would of liked it just a little lighter so I could enjoy more of the beautiful wood.  The wook adds to it.  It is a beautiful piece of technology that is relevant today, and still in use without any improvement needed on it.  Great shot.  Wish it were perfect cause it is so great.  PTL</td>', 'If you''re not going with 1/3s crop it evenly.  Beautiful photo.  Very clear of the subject.  Great subject.  The techs are right on.  Would of liked it just a little lighter so I could enjoy more of the beautiful wood.  The wook adds to it.  It is a beautiful piece of technology that is relevant today, and still in use without any improvement needed on it.  Great shot.  Wish it were perfect cause it is so great.  PTL', '2002-11-20 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156363, 8424, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I saw this pic and the first thing I thought is "I''d have backlit this one"  to accent the edges so it isn''t blended right into the backdrop.  I would have kept the top light where it is though, it looks nice there.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Great idea.  I saw this pic and the first thing I thought is "I''d have backlit this one"  to accent the edges so it isn''t blended right into the backdrop.  I would have kept the top light where it is though, it looks nice there.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 05:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156364, 8424, 4514, '<td valign="top">WEll this is technology.  Light is so important. Need to diffuse so there is not glare<br/></td>', 'WEll this is technology.  Light is so important. Need to diffuse so there is not glare', '2002-11-20 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156365, 8424, 4536, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting.</td>', 'I love the lighting.', '2002-11-21 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156366, 8424, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the dark background.  The lighting highlights the nice tones and markings  of the wood.  The glare on the glass could be improved upon, maybe by the light source being a little further away.  Overall this is nice and I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce  :-)</td>', 'I like the lighting and the dark background.  The lighting highlights the nice tones and markings  of the wood.  The glare on the glass could be improved upon, maybe by the light source being a little further away.  Overall this is nice and I like it.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce  :-)', '2002-11-21 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156367, 8424, 3087, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Harry Potter... don''t ask me why.<br/>Nice simple treatment - let the subject speak for itself...<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Reminds me of Harry Potter... don''t ask me why.Nice simple treatment - let the subject speak for itself...8, Kavey', '2002-11-22 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156368, 8424, 5149, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.</td>', 'Nice picture.', '2002-11-22 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156369, 8425, 4625, '<td valign="top">Neat, though a little cluttered. I might like it more if it was just the harddrive disk, and the hand reflection against a solid background.</td>', 'Neat, though a little cluttered. I might like it more if it was just the harddrive disk, and the hand reflection against a solid background.', '2002-11-18 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
