(156371, 8425, 2344, '<td valign="top">This image is wayy too busy. I dont know what to look at first! Eliminate most of the techhy parts if you want the focus to be on the hand. -4-</td>', 'This image is wayy too busy. I dont know what to look at first! Eliminate most of the techhy parts if you want the focus to be on the hand. -4-', '2002-11-18 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
