(156385, 8425, 4811, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot... Lots of elements carefully arranged and well lighted, and a well placed reflection on the hard disk. Not much else to say, I like the image just the way it is!</td>', 'I really like this shot... Lots of elements carefully arranged and well lighted, and a well placed reflection on the hard disk. Not much else to say, I like the image just the way it is!', '2002-11-20 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
