(156423, 8428, 4648, '<td valign="top">As long as there is need for food this will never be out of date.  This is the backbone of our country.  It''s also a nice clean, clear shot.  But I would have liked to see the "Farmall" you speak about in your title.  You didn''t say farmall tire.  Have to cut you for that.  I like the old tractors.  Still a great shot.  PTL</td>', 'As long as there is need for food this will never be out of date.  This is the backbone of our country.  It''s also a nice clean, clear shot.  But I would have liked to see the "Farmall" you speak about in your title.  You didn''t say farmall tire.  Have to cut you for that.  I like the old tractors.  Still a great shot.  PTL', '2002-11-23 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
