(156425, 8429, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love this.  I''m from Georgia and whenever I get a chance I love to go to the Amish country in Ohio and visit their farms.  I have several photos of them working their fields and driving their buggies.  This is a fantastic shot.  Just a tad dark, but can see it was a dark wet day.  Considering the day the dark is excused and used for atmosphere.  A really great 8 for this one.  PTL</td>', 'I love this.  I''m from Georgia and whenever I get a chance I love to go to the Amish country in Ohio and visit their farms.  I have several photos of them working their fields and driving their buggies.  This is a fantastic shot.  Just a tad dark, but can see it was a dark wet day.  Considering the day the dark is excused and used for atmosphere.  A really great 8 for this one.  PTL', '2002-11-18 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
