(156490, 8432, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great challenge job with a great photo with lots of needed humor.  I love the humore that is in this challenge.  Great job to all who attempted it.  I love the perfect pose.  The colors and focus are great.  There are several great ones, now to go back before midnight Sunday and pick the !st place winner. They get the two extra points.   PTL</td>', 'Great challenge job with a great photo with lots of needed humor.  I love the humore that is in this challenge.  Great job to all who attempted it.  I love the perfect pose.  The colors and focus are great.  There are several great ones, now to go back before midnight Sunday and pick the !st place winner. They get the two extra points.   PTL', '2002-11-19 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
