(156554, 8444, 2170, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting and uneven.  And, unfortunately, the lamp really washes out the left side of the photo as compared to the rest.  It''s even kind of hard to tell that there is a candle on the right.  The photo also needs to be straightened somewhat.  It''s leaning left.</td>', 'The background is distracting and uneven.  And, unfortunately, the lamp really washes out the left side of the photo as compared to the rest.  It''s even kind of hard to tell that there is a candle on the right.  The photo also needs to be straightened somewhat.  It''s leaning left.', '2002-11-18 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
