(156556, 8444, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition. Different candle would of worked better, but this is nice. Justine.</td>', 'Nice color and composition. Different candle would of worked better, but this is nice. Justine.', '2002-11-18 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
