(156593, 8446, 4648, '<td valign="top">Why turn them upside down?  I don''t understand.  Good shot, good focus, meets challenge, good color, great background.  Good techs.  Lacks "wow" and pizzaz to make it an 8 or above.  But overall good pic. PTL</td>', 'Why turn them upside down?  I don''t understand.  Good shot, good focus, meets challenge, good color, great background.  Good techs.  Lacks "wow" and pizzaz to make it an 8 or above.  But overall good pic. PTL', '2002-11-20 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
