(156596, 8446, 2700, '<td valign="top">cool effect. strange title... memory should never "envy" hard drives no matter what capacity of them. memory speed will always be faster than a physical hd.  memory speeds reach upwards of 4GB/swhere hd can only acheive a max of 100Mb/s... great picture though.... 8</td>', 'cool effect. strange title... memory should never "envy" hard drives no matter what capacity of them. memory speed will always be faster than a physical hd.  memory speeds reach upwards of 4GB/swhere hd can only acheive a max of 100Mb/s... great picture though.... 8', '2002-11-21 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
