(156613, 8447, 3540, '<td valign="top">I used to have these same Legos as kids.  I think my brother inherited them from "our" collection though admittedly they mostly were his.  I''m not wild about the whole idea.  I don''t know if I''d have used B&amp;W here either, but I don''t think it hurts the shot too much.  DOF is great.  Framing is not IMO and maybe this shot would''ve been helped out some with something else in it, like a moon buggy or his means of transport to the moon.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'I used to have these same Legos as kids.  I think my brother inherited them from "our" collection though admittedly they mostly were his.  I''m not wild about the whole idea.  I don''t know if I''d have used B&W here either, but I don''t think it hurts the shot too much.  DOF is great.  Framing is not IMO and maybe this shot would''ve been helped out some with something else in it, like a moon buggy or his means of transport to the moon.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
