(156622, 8447, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot though I am not sure I can explain why - I set it at 7 but it stood out from all my other 7s and I realised it''s up with my 8s.<br/>I like the dark background - very much the no atmosphere = black space sky...<br/>I love the light and shadow across the lego floor - what a wonderful texture... and the composition with the man central but the photo not because of the "moon rock stuff" and his shadow...<br/>I''d like just a very little more light on him and everything else just as it is...<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'I like this a lot though I am not sure I can explain why - I set it at 7 but it stood out from all my other 7s and I realised it''s up with my 8s.I like the dark background - very much the no atmosphere = black space sky...I love the light and shadow across the lego floor - what a wonderful texture... and the composition with the man central but the photo not because of the "moon rock stuff" and his shadow...I''d like just a very little more light on him and everything else just as it is...8, Kavey', '2002-11-22 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
