(156637, 8448, 4648, '<td valign="top">The extent some won''t go to for a great photo?  I love this.  I tried the cell phone and couldn''t get the lights to work this well.  Plus I didn''t have the "wow", the humor" to mine.  This week the humor is the "wow" for me.  Without "wow" you don''t score high at all.  That''s what makes a pic not just a photograph.  This one has "wow".  And - thanks for the humor.  I''ve enjoyed it.  PTL  The more I think about it, it not only has "wow" it has pizzaz and that deserves 2 more points for a top 10.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'The extent some won''t go to for a great photo?  I love this.  I tried the cell phone and couldn''t get the lights to work this well.  Plus I didn''t have the "wow", the humor" to mine.  This week the humor is the "wow" for me.  Without "wow" you don''t score high at all.  That''s what makes a pic not just a photograph.  This one has "wow".  And - thanks for the humor.  I''ve enjoyed it.  PTL  The more I think about it, it not only has "wow" it has pizzaz and that deserves 2 more points for a top 10.  Beautiful work.', '2002-11-19 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156638, 8448, 1280, '<td valign="top">I do know the feeling.  Hubby and I once gave up tv for years.  We were tempted to hammer it and throw it from the window.  Instead we donated it to charity.  But that was before cable......sighhhhhhhh <br/>Your picture meets the challenge,  has a little added interest with the hammer...a little cluttered with the background print.  Some emotion and humour.  Composition good.  Overall 5  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce</td>', 'I do know the feeling.  Hubby and I once gave up tv for years.  We were tempted to hammer it and throw it from the window.  Instead we donated it to charity.  But that was before cable......sighhhhhhhh Your picture meets the challenge,  has a little added interest with the hammer...a little cluttered with the background print.  Some emotion and humour.  Composition good.  Overall 5  Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce', '2002-11-20 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156639, 8448, 4514, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a problem.  :-)</td>', 'Oh this is a problem.  :-)', '2002-11-20 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
