(156641, 8448, 806, '<td valign="top">hahaha! yup.. with ya on this one! I don''t get what the words are in the paper behind it tho.. a bit distracting... is it connected at all to the image. I don''t think it was needed.</td>', 'hahaha! yup.. with ya on this one! I don''t get what the words are in the paper behind it tho.. a bit distracting... is it connected at all to the image. I don''t think it was needed.', '2002-11-23 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
