(156648, 8449, 2221, '<td valign="top">The photo looks very interesting, but I don''t know what it is. But that doesn''t matter much. It probably makes it that interesting _because_ I don''t know what it is. ;-) -stephan</td>', 'The photo looks very interesting, but I don''t know what it is. But that doesn''t matter much. It probably makes it that interesting _because_ I don''t know what it is. ;-) -stephan', '2002-11-24 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
