(156652, 8451, 3127, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the moon showing through the dish. Good color as well.</td>', 'Nice composition with the moon showing through the dish. Good color as well.', '2002-11-18 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156653, 8451, 3102, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have liked it better with the moon outside the dish, but still cool :)</td>', 'Personally I would have liked it better with the moon outside the dish, but still cool :)', '2002-11-18 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156654, 8451, 4536, '<td valign="top">way to go with the inclusion of the moon.<br/>there are little black specks in each bottom corner that are distracting also the white speck in the sky, too bad you couldn''t stamp them out :)<br/>I wonder if the placement of the moon out of the sattelite would have improved this shot?</td>', 'way to go with the inclusion of the moon.there are little black specks in each bottom corner that are distracting also the white speck in the sky, too bad you couldn''t stamp them out :)I wonder if the placement of the moon out of the sattelite would have improved this shot?', '2002-11-18 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156655, 8451, 4494, '<td valign="top">I like this one with Moon behind it.</td>', 'I like this one with Moon behind it.', '2002-11-18 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156656, 8451, 4998, '<td valign="top">the moon wouldve looked better on the right corner<br/></td>', 'the moon wouldve looked better on the right corner', '2002-11-18 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156657, 8451, 1280, '<td valign="top">The first thing that strikes me is the lovely sky blue sky...hehehe.  I love how you incorporated the moon.   You positioned the dish beautifully into the composition, and the entire image is pleasing.  You definetly meet the challenge.  Good job.  7  Grayce</td>', 'The first thing that strikes me is the lovely sky blue sky...hehehe.  I love how you incorporated the moon.   You positioned the dish beautifully into the composition, and the entire image is pleasing.  You definetly meet the challenge.  Good job.  7  Grayce', '2002-11-19 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156658, 8451, 4906, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like the placement of the moon. I think it would have worked better with the moon in the right of the image. I liked the idea though and nice title.</td>', 'I didn''t like the placement of the moon. I think it would have worked better with the moon in the right of the image. I liked the idea though and nice title.', '2002-11-20 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156659, 8451, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  The moon in this shot makes alot more interesing.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Nice colours.  The moon in this shot makes alot more interesing.  Jacko.  7', '2002-11-20 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156660, 8451, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like how the moon shows through the antennea, but (truly a nit) it''s not fully centered in that section (see, I told you it was a small issue).  9 Swash</td>', 'Very nice!  I like how the moon shows through the antennea, but (truly a nit) it''s not fully centered in that section (see, I told you it was a small issue).  9 Swash', '2002-11-20 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156661, 8451, 4615, '<td valign="top">Well composed.</td>', 'Well composed.', '2002-11-20 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156662, 8451, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very good. Idea.  There has to be something that could have been done to really make this thing have some bite.  The title is great.</td>', 'Very good. Idea.  There has to be something that could have been done to really make this thing have some bite.  The title is great.', '2002-11-21 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156663, 8451, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good clean shot.  Really like the moon through the dish and the plane on the right side.  Wonder how many saw that.  Clean shot.  Meets challenge well.  Nice crop - other won''t understand if they don''t see the plane.  Lacks "wow" that jumps out at you but otherwise real good shot.  PTL</td>', 'Good clean shot.  Really like the moon through the dish and the plane on the right side.  Wonder how many saw that.  Clean shot.  Meets challenge well.  Nice crop - other won''t understand if they don''t see the plane.  Lacks "wow" that jumps out at you but otherwise real good shot.  PTL', '2002-11-21 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156664, 8451, 2978, '<td valign="top">What if the moon is on the to right of the frame.</td>', 'What if the moon is on the to right of the frame.', '2002-11-22 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156665, 8451, 1202, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a nice take.    Keep up the good work.   Autool</td>', 'Congrats on a nice take.    Keep up the good work.   Autool', '2002-11-25 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(156666, 8451, 1585, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the nice comments. Just goes to show that you can satisfy all of the pesimists some of the time but not some of the optimists all of the time. Or something like that.</td>', 'Thank you all for the nice comments. Just goes to show that you can satisfy all of the pesimists some of the time but not some of the optimists all of the time. Or something like that.', '2002-11-25 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
