(156676, 8452, 2667, '<td valign="top">that thing looks like the "pop pie" from hell... definitely not from Swanson! nice pic, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'that thing looks like the "pop pie" from hell... definitely not from Swanson! nice pic, and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-11-23 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156677, 8452, 4648, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like he is going to the extreme to make a chicken pot pie.  Look at it carefully and see if you don''t see that.  This is really "Technology at work".  Love how he really looks like he is totally consumed by the experiment.  Great composition.  If staged, great job.  Focus is right on.  Crop job is super.  Very interesting photo.  It stirs ones attention.  Well done.  PTL.  Deserves everybit of a 9</td>', 'It almost looks like he is going to the extreme to make a chicken pot pie.  Look at it carefully and see if you don''t see that.  This is really "Technology at work".  Love how he really looks like he is totally consumed by the experiment.  Great composition.  If staged, great job.  Focus is right on.  Crop job is super.  Very interesting photo.  It stirs ones attention.  Well done.  PTL.  Deserves everybit of a 9', '2002-11-23 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156678, 8452, 806, '<td valign="top">now, what is funny/cool here, is that in, say 30 - 40 years or less maybe, this image will document what once was, and there will be people saying "wow! imagine how they USED to do that!!!" .. good work.</td>', 'now, what is funny/cool here, is that in, say 30 - 40 years or less maybe, this image will document what once was, and there will be people saying "wow! imagine how they USED to do that!!!" .. good work.', '2002-11-23 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156679, 8454, 811, '<td valign="top">Great colors and clarity. karmat</td>', 'Great colors and clarity. karmat', '2002-11-18 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156680, 8454, 2792, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great photo!  8/10</td>', 'Great idea, great photo!  8/10', '2002-11-18 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156681, 8454, 327, '<td valign="top">What''s new is old.....Well done, good composition. Justine</td>', 'What''s new is old.....Well done, good composition. Justine', '2002-11-18 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156682, 8454, 1280, '<td valign="top">Focus is good on this, but there is just a little something lacking....maybe it''s because I look at this every single day, I have a hard time seeing the artistic merit.  Just me prolly. Technically the picture is fine.   Anyway good luck in the challenge.  6  Grayce</td>', 'Focus is good on this, but there is just a little something lacking....maybe it''s because I look at this every single day, I have a hard time seeing the artistic merit.  Just me prolly. Technically the picture is fine.   Anyway good luck in the challenge.  6  Grayce', '2002-11-19 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156683, 8454, 4648, '<td valign="top">What lighting did you use?  I love it.  The phone is so clear with no glare and the screen reads so well.  Great techs.  The page in the book makes it.  Wonder how many will even see the "Motor for......."?  Bet not man look that closely and they will miss a good part of the shot.  Great job.  Great techs.  Well done.  PTL</td>', 'What lighting did you use?  I love it.  The phone is so clear with no glare and the screen reads so well.  Great techs.  The page in the book makes it.  Wonder how many will even see the "Motor for......."?  Bet not man look that closely and they will miss a good part of the shot.  Great job.  Great techs.  Well done.  PTL', '2002-11-20 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156684, 8454, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good colour.</td>', 'Good colour.', '2002-11-20 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156685, 8454, 4517, '<td valign="top">ahhhh not another phone..very sharp pic</td>', 'ahhhh not another phone..very sharp pic', '2002-11-20 04:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156686, 8454, 4906, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred darker lighting. The phone stands out too much and the image in the book doesn''t stand out enough.</td>', 'I would have preferred darker lighting. The phone stands out too much and the image in the book doesn''t stand out enough.', '2002-11-20 06:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156687, 8454, 4514, '<td valign="top">Telephones are so overdone.</td>', 'Telephones are so overdone.', '2002-11-20 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156688, 8454, 2488, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp!well done</td>', 'Nice and sharp!well done', '2002-11-21 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156689, 8455, 3540, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a "Silcon valley xray" or something like that.  Well done.  Love the concept and I really don''t see anything I don''t like. - Inspzil</td>', 'This reminds me of a "Silcon valley xray" or something like that.  Well done.  Love the concept and I really don''t see anything I don''t like. - Inspzil', '2002-11-18 05:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156690, 8455, 3506, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''m not sure I know how you did this.  I''m guessing the board was backlit when you shot the photo and then you did a greyscale conversion and some levels/contrast adjustments.  If you have the time I''d like a quick note on what you really did to get this shot.  Thanks.  SSonnentag (shawn@sonnentag.net) (7)</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''m not sure I know how you did this.  I''m guessing the board was backlit when you shot the photo and then you did a greyscale conversion and some levels/contrast adjustments.  If you have the time I''d like a quick note on what you really did to get this shot.  Thanks.  SSonnentag (shawn@sonnentag.net) (7)', '2002-11-18 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156691, 8455, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love this for b&amp;w...it''s a tad crooked and offcentered (something that is unusually important in this type of image to me)..but otherwise awesome 8 Lisa</td>', 'I love this for b&w...it''s a tad crooked and offcentered (something that is unusually important in this type of image to me)..but otherwise awesome 8 Lisa', '2002-11-18 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156692, 8455, 772, '<td valign="top">In the ''technology'' challenge, I expected to see a lot of photos of circuit boards.  Knowing this, I believe that these photos need to be done more creatively in an attempt to make them stand out.  How could you have made this photograph more impactive?  If you are new to the challenge concept, one thing you may consider is ASSUMING that there will be several other photos like yours each week.  In many cases, there are!  With this in mind, you need to create impact....  - setzler</td>', 'In the ''technology'' challenge, I expected to see a lot of photos of circuit boards.  Knowing this, I believe that these photos need to be done more creatively in an attempt to make them stand out.  How could you have made this photograph more impactive?  If you are new to the challenge concept, one thing you may consider is ASSUMING that there will be several other photos like yours each week.  In many cases, there are!  With this in mind, you need to create impact....  - setzler', '2002-11-18 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156693, 8455, 4829, '<td valign="top">Great photo, the black and white works for it, would have enjoyed the color version as well...-7- CreativeDotCom</td>', 'Great photo, the black and white works for it, would have enjoyed the color version as well...-7- CreativeDotCom', '2002-11-18 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156694, 8455, 3127, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w image for this. It''s a nice change</td>', 'I like the b&w image for this. It''s a nice change', '2002-11-18 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156695, 8455, 4625, '<td valign="top">This gives a whole new view of the circuit board. There''ve been a bunch of circuit shots in this challenge, but this one is unique, nicely done.</td>', 'This gives a whole new view of the circuit board. There''ve been a bunch of circuit shots in this challenge, but this one is unique, nicely done.', '2002-11-18 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156696, 8455, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oooo, nice name!</td>', 'Oooo, nice name!', '2002-11-18 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156697, 8455, 4388, '<td valign="top">looks negative, i like it!</td>', 'looks negative, i like it!', '2002-11-18 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156698, 8455, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, however you might want to coniser tilting the picture to the left a little bit.  Jacko  6</td>', 'I like the shot, however you might want to coniser tilting the picture to the left a little bit.  Jacko  6', '2002-11-18 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156699, 8455, 4177, '<td valign="top">Seriously good. Mostly backlit with just enough front lighting to bring out the major components. Mighty fine!</td>', 'Seriously good. Mostly backlit with just enough front lighting to bring out the major components. Mighty fine!', '2002-11-18 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156700, 8455, 3575, '<td valign="top">Oooo. This is a great circuit board photo. You lit from below and still got enough light on top to read the lettering.</td>', 'Oooo. This is a great circuit board photo. You lit from below and still got enough light on top to read the lettering.', '2002-11-19 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1);
