(156756, 8458, 4648, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what technology this is but it is beautiful, absolutely beautiful.  I gotta know how you accomplished this.  Should have cropped a little more off the top - that little empty space adds nothing.  Great colors, good subject, great compotision.  Really great pic for an 8.  PTL</td>', 'I don''t know what technology this is but it is beautiful, absolutely beautiful.  I gotta know how you accomplished this.  Should have cropped a little more off the top - that little empty space adds nothing.  Great colors, good subject, great compotision.  Really great pic for an 8.  PTL', '2002-11-23 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
