(156891, 8476, 4648, '<td valign="top">Unique color.  Don''t know what you did to get it but it doesn''t get it for me.  Almost looks like a negative.  No personal appeal here.  Sorry.  It''s just my opinion.  Techs are good for what ever you did.  That''s all that saved the score.  PTL</td>', 'Unique color.  Don''t know what you did to get it but it doesn''t get it for me.  Almost looks like a negative.  No personal appeal here.  Sorry.  It''s just my opinion.  Techs are good for what ever you did.  That''s all that saved the score.  PTL', '2002-11-20 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156892, 8476, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I''m not sure if this is negative, IR, but it is cool regardless of what it is.  My only beef about this pic is that the horizon runs downhill from L to R.  Other than that, I see no reason why I shouldn''t give this a solid 4.  Kidding!!!  How ''bout eight instead?  Nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'Cool shot.  I''m not sure if this is negative, IR, but it is cool regardless of what it is.  My only beef about this pic is that the horizon runs downhill from L to R.  Other than that, I see no reason why I shouldn''t give this a solid 4.  Kidding!!!  How ''bout eight instead?  Nice job - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 04:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156893, 8476, 4210, '<td valign="top">Seems very clean and clinical, which I think was your intention.</td>', 'Seems very clean and clinical, which I think was your intention.', '2002-11-20 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156894, 8476, 4514, '<td valign="top">Now this is a diff. shot.  Not bad.  I like it for some reason.</td>', 'Now this is a diff. shot.  Not bad.  I like it for some reason.', '2002-11-20 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156895, 8476, 2858, '<td valign="top">Great effect with lots of interesting detail. Good composition.</td>', 'Great effect with lots of interesting detail. Good composition.', '2002-11-21 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156896, 8476, 5121, '<td valign="top">Looks good as a neg.</td>', 'Looks good as a neg.', '2002-11-22 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
