(157176, 8501, 4887, '<td valign="top">I guess beauty really is in the eye of the beholder and unfortunately I don''t see much to interest me in this poto.</td>', 'I guess beauty really is in the eye of the beholder and unfortunately I don''t see much to interest me in this poto.', '2002-11-18 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157177, 8501, 4267, '<td valign="top">did you use sepia? the pic looks nice and old-timey... just like the watch... good work..<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'did you use sepia? the pic looks nice and old-timey... just like the watch... good work..~anachronite', '2002-11-18 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157178, 8501, 4210, '<td valign="top">I don''t really know if I like the sepis look to this photo, but I would have to see the original to know for sure. Good job with the lighting and having little to no glare.</td>', 'I don''t really know if I like the sepis look to this photo, but I would have to see the original to know for sure. Good job with the lighting and having little to no glare.', '2002-11-20 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157179, 8501, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great old watch.  Does it still run.  I collect old watches.  I try to get them all running.  My famorite ones are the self winding or "automatic" ones.  The next are any with "sweep" second hands.  I love the color.  Wish the crop wasn''t so tight, good focus, and good subject.  Great for challenge.  Good job.  PTL</td>', 'Great old watch.  Does it still run.  I collect old watches.  I try to get them all running.  My famorite ones are the self winding or "automatic" ones.  The next are any with "sweep" second hands.  I love the color.  Wish the crop wasn''t so tight, good focus, and good subject.  Great for challenge.  Good job.  PTL', '2002-11-20 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157180, 8501, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting.  Nee more focus.</td>', 'Intresting.  Nee more focus.', '2002-11-21 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157181, 8501, 2182, '<td valign="top">Great focus, good subject</td>', 'Great focus, good subject', '2002-11-21 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157182, 8501, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sepia effect.  All the curves are appealing.  Focus is good but just a little soft. Meets the challenge creatively.  Consider side lighting to highlight the 3 dimensions.   Good luck in the challenge!  7 Grayce</td>', 'Nice composition and sepia effect.  All the curves are appealing.  Focus is good but just a little soft. Meets the challenge creatively.  Consider side lighting to highlight the 3 dimensions.   Good luck in the challenge!  7 Grayce', '2002-11-21 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157183, 8501, 2989, '<td valign="top">This looks like a picture of a picture.  No Depth of Field that I can see indiciating a lower score from me.</td>', 'This looks like a picture of a picture.  No Depth of Field that I can see indiciating a lower score from me.', '2002-11-22 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157184, 8501, 5121, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I find myself studying all the little cogs and wheels. Nice and sharp right down to the words and serial number on the edge!<br/><br/></td>', 'Excellent.  I find myself studying all the little cogs and wheels. Nice and sharp right down to the words and serial number on the edge!', '2002-11-22 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157185, 8501, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture is one of the very few that can pull off a soft focus shot.  This is a very effective shot.  Despite the focus being a little shot there is a lot of detail involved.  The angle is good.  The choice of this tone was a very sound one.  The only thing about this shot that I don''t like is that bit of the hinge and lid showing on the right side.  I know it''s supposed to be there but I have this feeling of interruption by it.  I think you should''ve shown more, or none of it.  Its an excellent shot.  I initially gave it  a 7, but I''m going to change that to an 8.  If you don''t like it, PM me and I''ll change it back. - Inspzil</td>', 'This picture is one of the very few that can pull off a soft focus shot.  This is a very effective shot.  Despite the focus being a little shot there is a lot of detail involved.  The angle is good.  The choice of this tone was a very sound one.  The only thing about this shot that I don''t like is that bit of the hinge and lid showing on the right side.  I know it''s supposed to be there but I have this feeling of interruption by it.  I think you should''ve shown more, or none of it.  Its an excellent shot.  I initially gave it  a 7, but I''m going to change that to an 8.  If you don''t like it, PM me and I''ll change it back. - Inspzil', '2002-11-24 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157186, 8502, 327, '<td valign="top">True. Fun shot. Justine</td>', 'True. Fun shot. Justine', '2002-11-18 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157187, 8502, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but should have found a more "interesting" intersection.</td>', 'Nice idea, but should have found a more "interesting" intersection.', '2002-11-18 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157188, 8502, 3575, '<td valign="top">Overlooked? I hope you don''t overlook that technology :)</td>', 'Overlooked? I hope you don''t overlook that technology :)', '2002-11-20 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157189, 8502, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not very well thought out.  What is that light from above?  A street light or a Flying saucer.  Good title but use a tripod if it is still blurry use the timer to go off in two seconds so when you press the button you have time to take your finger off the camera without shaking it.</td>', 'Not very well thought out.  What is that light from above?  A street light or a Flying saucer.  Good title but use a tripod if it is still blurry use the timer to go off in two seconds so when you press the button you have time to take your finger off the camera without shaking it.', '2002-11-21 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157190, 8502, 4536, '<td valign="top">I find myself trying to read the street sign.</td>', 'I find myself trying to read the street sign.', '2002-11-21 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157191, 8502, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really neat night shot.  Can see the green light and the red one also.  Maybe a busier corner where there were more store light or traffic for interest .  Like how the street sign is on one side and the traffic light on the other side - frames the picture well.  Good shot.  PTL</td>', 'Really neat night shot.  Can see the green light and the red one also.  Maybe a busier corner where there were more store light or traffic for interest .  Like how the street sign is on one side and the traffic light on the other side - frames the picture well.  Good shot.  PTL', '2002-11-23 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157192, 8504, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus on this looks very soft to me.  I think I would like to see it a bit sharper.  I like the rainbows though, and how the whole subject fills the frame.  The angle is very nice as well.  Good colors. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'The focus on this looks very soft to me.  I think I would like to see it a bit sharper.  I like the rainbows though, and how the whole subject fills the frame.  The angle is very nice as well.  Good colors. Good luck in the challenge. ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-11-18 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
