(157225, 8505, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I really like it.  Clear and crisp.  Great colors.  Right on for challenge with human interest besides.  In my opinion it shows great technology of putting up a farm fence or cattle fence.  Great shot technically correct as far as I''m concerned.  Great for a 9 PTL  Took another couple looks and I''m sure this is a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I really like it.  Clear and crisp.  Great colors.  Right on for challenge with human interest besides.  In my opinion it shows great technology of putting up a farm fence or cattle fence.  Great shot technically correct as far as I''m concerned.  Great for a 9 PTL  Took another couple looks and I''m sure this is a 10.', '2002-11-21 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157226, 8505, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this, and the dof really makes the texture and details of the main post stand out.  I like your interpretation of the challenge. karmat</td>', 'I like the composition on this, and the dof really makes the texture and details of the main post stand out.  I like your interpretation of the challenge. karmat', '2002-11-22 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
