(157234, 8506, 4648, '<td valign="top">I expected bifocals.  Are these the no line ones?  Screen out of focus and it is half of the photo.  The other half is in good focus.  Good idea but needs better execution.    But not bad.  PTL  Rethought this and maybe screen out of focus is intentional to emphasize reason for glasses.  If that the case deserves a 7</td>', 'I expected bifocals.  Are these the no line ones?  Screen out of focus and it is half of the photo.  The other half is in good focus.  Good idea but needs better execution.    But not bad.  PTL  Rethought this and maybe screen out of focus is intentional to emphasize reason for glasses.  If that the case deserves a 7', '2002-11-21 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157235, 8506, 3882, '<td valign="top">Neat Idea!</td>', 'Neat Idea!', '2002-11-22 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
