(157244, 8507, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite read above the MC 15 or 16 Super II.  So I don''t know what this is.  I do know what it is as a photograph - it is good except too dark, especially in the top right hand corner.  Can''t see well enough to figure out what it is.   Still a technically good photo, but part of the job is to tell you "I''m a........."  Wish it had.  PLT</td>', 'I can''t quite read above the MC 15 or 16 Super II.  So I don''t know what this is.  I do know what it is as a photograph - it is good except too dark, especially in the top right hand corner.  Can''t see well enough to figure out what it is.   Still a technically good photo, but part of the job is to tell you "I''m a........."  Wish it had.  PLT', '2002-11-19 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
