(157254, 8507, 4906, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. I was surprised to see 3 very similar images this week. I guess my idea wasn''t as original as I had thought :o) I think I should have made the lighting a little stronger since a numer of people had difficulty distinguishing some of the detail.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. I was surprised to see 3 very similar images this week. I guess my idea wasn''t as original as I had thought :o) I think I should have made the lighting a little stronger since a numer of people had difficulty distinguishing some of the detail.', '2002-11-25 04:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157255, 8508, 3127, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and nice clarity.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and nice clarity.', '2002-11-18 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157256, 8508, 327, '<td valign="top">Sidney? Very cool ship, beautiful blue sky too. I think the composition could of been improved.  Justine.</td>', 'Sidney? Very cool ship, beautiful blue sky too. I think the composition could of been improved.  Justine.', '2002-11-18 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157257, 8508, 4411, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the way the sails ''collide'' with building. I''m sure there''s a great shot here from a different angle (especially if you can catch it with the sails down - that would look magnificent).</td>', 'I''m not keen on the way the sails ''collide'' with building. I''m sure there''s a great shot here from a different angle (especially if you can catch it with the sails down - that would look magnificent).', '2002-11-19 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157258, 8508, 4906, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy and the railings detract from the image too.</td>', 'The background is too busy and the railings detract from the image too.', '2002-11-20 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157259, 8508, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting shot.  Hope the trip to Australia was fun.</td>', 'Intresting shot.  Hope the trip to Australia was fun.', '2002-11-21 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157260, 8508, 671, '<td valign="top">too bad you couldn''t blurr the opera house out of the background.  5</td>', 'too bad you couldn''t blurr the opera house out of the background.  5', '2002-11-22 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157261, 8508, 3447, '<td valign="top">Ah, you Aussies have such a wonderful site in Sydney - and you have a very good photographer''s eye to capture it.     7      JEM</td>', 'Ah, you Aussies have such a wonderful site in Sydney - and you have a very good photographer''s eye to capture it.     7      JEM', '2002-11-22 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157262, 8508, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful old ship with great character.  You need to show all that character.  This was a 10 photo for photo quality and technology, interest, meeting challenge, great colors, etc. then you dropped it down to an 8 by cropping off the rest of the boat!  Why, of why?  PTL</td>', 'This is a beautiful old ship with great character.  You need to show all that character.  This was a 10 photo for photo quality and technology, interest, meeting challenge, great colors, etc. then you dropped it down to an 8 by cropping off the rest of the boat!  Why, of why?  PTL', '2002-11-23 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157263, 8508, 4517, '<td valign="top">great mix of old and new tech 7 marbo</td>', 'great mix of old and new tech 7 marbo', '2002-11-24 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157264, 8509, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of humor!! There are some speckles or something in the background, I think.  Was that deliberate?   karmat</td>', 'Good use of humor!! There are some speckles or something in the background, I think.  Was that deliberate?   karmat', '2002-11-18 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157265, 8509, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words for the title.</td>', 'Nice play on words for the title.', '2002-11-18 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157266, 8509, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2002-11-18 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157267, 8509, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and good color.  The reflection on the screen is a little harsh, but overall a nice photo.</td>', 'Excellent focus and good color.  The reflection on the screen is a little harsh, but overall a nice photo.', '2002-11-18 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157268, 8509, 4177, '<td valign="top">I think the glare on the readout detracts from the overall effect.</td>', 'I think the glare on the readout detracts from the overall effect.', '2002-11-18 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157269, 8509, 5088, '<td valign="top">Aww! The poor calculator! :P</td>', 'Aww! The poor calculator! :P', '2002-11-19 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157270, 8509, 1280, '<td valign="top">This could have been prety boring, but you made it interesting by having a beat up example.   Good job!  Lighting and focus are fine, and meets the challenge.   I have a confession to make though.  I favor "pretty" pictures.   BUT, because of the merits here you still score well.  7    Anyway, good luck in the challenge.  Grayce</td>', 'This could have been prety boring, but you made it interesting by having a beat up example.   Good job!  Lighting and focus are fine, and meets the challenge.   I have a confession to make though.  I favor "pretty" pictures.   BUT, because of the merits here you still score well.  7    Anyway, good luck in the challenge.  Grayce', '2002-11-20 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157271, 8509, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  Met the challenge<br/></td>', 'Not bad.  Met the challenge', '2002-11-20 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157272, 8509, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Techs are right one.  Good color.  Great focus.  Nice crop job.  Like the black background.  Lighting is good, no bad glares.  Good challenge meeting.  Over great picture.  Best part of the whole thing is the humor.  I love the humor along with a great pic.  Well done.  PTL  Thought about it and had to come back and add a point for a 9.  It deserves it.</td>', 'Great shot.  Techs are right one.  Good color.  Great focus.  Nice crop job.  Like the black background.  Lighting is good, no bad glares.  Good challenge meeting.  Over great picture.  Best part of the whole thing is the humor.  I love the humor along with a great pic.  Well done.  PTL  Thought about it and had to come back and add a point for a 9.  It deserves it.', '2002-11-21 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157273, 8510, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding idea.  Putting this idea into a picture, well it wasn''t executed as well as I think it could have.  It''s sort of generally fuzzy.  It''s not horizontally lined up, nor way off as is sometimes done on purpose.  I think it really had the potential to be a great shot.  Hope you get something positive out of this critique - Good Luck, Inspzil</td>', 'This is an outstanding idea.  Putting this idea into a picture, well it wasn''t executed as well as I think it could have.  It''s sort of generally fuzzy.  It''s not horizontally lined up, nor way off as is sometimes done on purpose.  I think it really had the potential to be a great shot.  Hope you get something positive out of this critique - Good Luck, Inspzil', '2002-11-18 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157274, 8510, 2170, '<td valign="top">This photo should be straightened.  It''s not a very interesting take on the topic....  Perhaps showing the machine in use would have made it more powerful?  I also thing it would be better if it were not cropped so abruptly on the left.</td>', 'This photo should be straightened.  It''s not a very interesting take on the topic....  Perhaps showing the machine in use would have made it more powerful?  I also thing it would be better if it were not cropped so abruptly on the left.', '2002-11-18 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157275, 8510, 4536, '<td valign="top">looks a bit grey, needs some more contrast.<br/>I think the composition is off some, not quite square, not off set.</td>', 'looks a bit grey, needs some more contrast.I think the composition is off some, not quite square, not off set.', '2002-11-18 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157276, 8510, 327, '<td valign="top">So nice that we have come so far!</td>', 'So nice that we have come so far!', '2002-11-18 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157277, 8510, 3575, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if it was either straight or angled so it looked like it was by design and not cropped so much on the left side of the object.</td>', 'I would like this better if it was either straight or angled so it looked like it was by design and not cropped so much on the left side of the object.', '2002-11-20 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157278, 8510, 4514, '<td valign="top">Closer would have been better.</td>', 'Closer would have been better.', '2002-11-21 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157279, 8510, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I''ve never seen one of these.  Good subject.  Could use a little light and better croping.  The dead space at the bottom adds nothing and then you cropped off the left side.  Needs better centering.  Otherwise great photo.  PTL</td>', 'Very interesting.  I''ve never seen one of these.  Good subject.  Could use a little light and better croping.  The dead space at the bottom adds nothing and then you cropped off the left side.  Needs better centering.  Otherwise great photo.  PTL', '2002-11-23 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157280, 8510, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is something I''ve never seen before.  I find it very interesting because I have always been interested in things that help people communicate, and I''ve always had a very keen interest in helping people who are at any kind of disadvantage.  This is very, very cool!  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'This is something I''ve never seen before.  I find it very interesting because I have always been interested in things that help people communicate, and I''ve always had a very keen interest in helping people who are at any kind of disadvantage.  This is very, very cool!  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-24 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157281, 8510, 4701, '<td valign="top">10+</td>', '10+', '2002-11-24 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157282, 8511, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, cleverly done.</td>', 'Nice subject, cleverly done.', '2002-11-18 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157283, 8511, 1569, '<td valign="top">Shades of ''Max Headroom'' --Great idea and pix.</td>', 'Shades of ''Max Headroom'' --Great idea and pix.', '2002-11-18 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157284, 8511, 327, '<td valign="top">My gosh you''ve got a lot of icons on your screen. One big one too!! Clever. Justine</td>', 'My gosh you''ve got a lot of icons on your screen. One big one too!! Clever. Justine', '2002-11-18 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157285, 8511, 4494, '<td valign="top">How''d you do that?</td>', 'How''d you do that?', '2002-11-18 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157286, 8511, 4267, '<td valign="top">I like this one, and I would like it more if the keyboard were cropped out and all we saw was the monitor<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'I like this one, and I would like it more if the keyboard were cropped out and all we saw was the monitor~anachronite', '2002-11-18 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157287, 8511, 4510, '<td valign="top">GOOD SHOT !! LOOKS LIKE A PRISIONER OF TECHNOLOGY</td>', 'GOOD SHOT !! LOOKS LIKE A PRISIONER OF TECHNOLOGY', '2002-11-19 06:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157288, 8511, 4648, '<td valign="top">I almost died laughing when I saw this.  It is so funny.  And I don''t even like these red shots worth a 3.  But this is so funny.  Good shot of the screen and you (It is you I assume).  Is this a self portrait?    The screen is the subject so I don''t really care about the rest of the pic.  You could crop out the rest of it and it would improve for me.  The "wow" is the "funny".  I like a good laugh.  PTL</td>', 'I almost died laughing when I saw this.  It is so funny.  And I don''t even like these red shots worth a 3.  But this is so funny.  Good shot of the screen and you (It is you I assume).  Is this a self portrait?    The screen is the subject so I don''t really care about the rest of the pic.  You could crop out the rest of it and it would improve for me.  The "wow" is the "funny".  I like a good laugh.  PTL', '2002-11-19 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157289, 8511, 2170, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s different.  I think the monitor could be centered more -- this seems kind of slipshot.</td>', 'Well, it''s different.  I think the monitor could be centered more -- this seems kind of slipshot.', '2002-11-19 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157290, 8511, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture of a picture on a screen.  Meets the challenge.  Not sure about this though.  Not sure why either....I will come back to this one.  If I don''t, please remind me.  I''d sort of like to discuss it.  Like the picture on the screen, did you take that this week?  The picture on the screen is the main subject?  But the picture has obviously been manipulated.  So is it ok to take a picture of a picture that was attained via illegal means?  I''m scratching my head over this one.  Hope you don''t mind...just being honest.  lol....don''t pay me too much mind or I''ll have YOU scratching your head in wonder.....As of now 6....may change later.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.  Grayce</td>', 'Interesting picture of a picture on a screen.  Meets the challenge.  Not sure about this though.  Not sure why either....I will come back to this one.  If I don''t, please remind me.  I''d sort of like to discuss it.  Like the picture on the screen, did you take that this week?  The picture on the screen is the main subject?  But the picture has obviously been manipulated.  So is it ok to take a picture of a picture that was attained via illegal means?  I''m scratching my head over this one.  Hope you don''t mind...just being honest.  lol....don''t pay me too much mind or I''ll have YOU scratching your head in wonder.....As of now 6....may change later.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.  Grayce', '2002-11-19 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157291, 8511, 4969, '<td valign="top">I love the Self-Portrait if it is its a Ten</td>', 'I love the Self-Portrait if it is its a Ten', '2002-11-19 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157292, 8511, 4514, '<td valign="top">Different and intresing.  Artistic.  Very nice.  Should have zoomed in a little more.</td>', 'Different and intresing.  Artistic.  Very nice.  Should have zoomed in a little more.', '2002-11-20 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157293, 8511, 5302, '<td valign="top">Very interesting , but appears to be more the result of editing than a photograhy</td>', 'Very interesting , but appears to be more the result of editing than a photograhy', '2002-11-22 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157294, 8511, 3416, '<td valign="top">good idea, in my opinion could better be left in horizontal and macro, single the screen.</td>', 'good idea, in my opinion could better be left in horizontal and macro, single the screen.', '2002-11-23 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157295, 8511, 5316, '<td valign="top">Intersting idea!</td>', 'Intersting idea!', '2002-11-24 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157296, 8512, 811, '<td valign="top">Good colors, focus and compostition.  Probably works better than a "new" spell check, any time! karmat</td>', 'Good colors, focus and compostition.  Probably works better than a "new" spell check, any time! karmat', '2002-11-18 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157297, 8512, 2344, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t scream technology to me. It''s a piece of paper and a dictionary</td>', 'This just doesn''t scream technology to me. It''s a piece of paper and a dictionary', '2002-11-18 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157298, 8512, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice idea :o) Would have preferred a steeper angle to make text more readable on page as I find it detracts from the actual point of the image.</td>', 'Nice idea :o) Would have preferred a steeper angle to make text more readable on page as I find it detracts from the actual point of the image.', '2002-11-18 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157299, 8512, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oh, great idea... You needed a really old big dictionary, on a old desk, with candle light, and some old fashioned paper and an ink pen.  That would be oustanding!</td>', 'Oh, great idea... You needed a really old big dictionary, on a old desk, with candle light, and some old fashioned paper and an ink pen.  That would be oustanding!', '2002-11-18 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157300, 8512, 327, '<td valign="top">Good work. Nice job. Justine</td>', 'Good work. Nice job. Justine', '2002-11-18 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(157301, 8512, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love it, I love it.  Not only a sharp, very clear and great pic, but a good laugh to go along with it.  This is wonderful.  Great one for the challenge.  Super colors.  I love the subject and composition.  Thanks for the fun.  PTL  As I re-check your spell-check I realize it needs another point for a 9</td>', 'I love it, I love it.  Not only a sharp, very clear and great pic, but a good laugh to go along with it.  This is wonderful.  Great one for the challenge.  Super colors.  I love the subject and composition.  Thanks for the fun.  PTL  As I re-check your spell-check I realize it needs another point for a 9', '2002-11-19 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157302, 8512, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  Good focus.  extra half point for readable handwriting.  And half point for meeting challenge.</td>', 'Not a bad idea.  Good focus.  extra half point for readable handwriting.  And half point for meeting challenge.', '2002-11-20 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157303, 8512, 1792, '<td valign="top">Well composed.</td>', 'Well composed.', '2002-11-21 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157304, 8512, 2182, '<td valign="top">Good picture, catchy title</td>', 'Good picture, catchy title', '2002-11-21 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157305, 8512, 5121, '<td valign="top">Original idea.  Nice composition.<br/><br/></td>', 'Original idea.  Nice composition.', '2002-11-22 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157306, 8512, 671, '<td valign="top">weak on the challenge</td>', 'weak on the challenge', '2002-11-22 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157307, 8513, 2170, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good macro shot too.  Good DOF, but I think the background color is a little distracting.</td>', 'This would have been a good macro shot too.  Good DOF, but I think the background color is a little distracting.', '2002-11-18 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157308, 8513, 3127, '<td valign="top">Good contrasting background color.</td>', 'Good contrasting background color.', '2002-11-18 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157309, 8513, 811, '<td valign="top">A different or darker background would have made the plastic show up better, I believe. Otherwise, i really like this shot and idea. karmat</td>', 'A different or darker background would have made the plastic show up better, I believe. Otherwise, i really like this shot and idea. karmat', '2002-11-18 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157310, 8513, 327, '<td valign="top">Fine idea. Focus is a tad bit soft, but it''s right on the subject. Justine</td>', 'Fine idea. Focus is a tad bit soft, but it''s right on the subject. Justine', '2002-11-18 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157311, 8513, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, nice negative space.  I''d like a bit more focus.  Jacko.</td>', 'Cute shot, nice negative space.  I''d like a bit more focus.  Jacko.', '2002-11-20 06:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157312, 8513, 2241, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the colors in this image</td>', 'I like the idea and the colors in this image', '2002-11-20 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157313, 8513, 2125, '<td valign="top">awesome 10</td>', 'awesome 10', '2002-11-20 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157314, 8513, 4514, '<td valign="top">Need focus.</td>', 'Need focus.', '2002-11-21 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157315, 8513, 4517, '<td valign="top">not so sure about the tiltle but the pics not bad. 6 marbo</td>', 'not so sure about the tiltle but the pics not bad. 6 marbo', '2002-11-21 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157316, 8513, 4648, '<td valign="top">He can''t phone home, he is sitting on my shelf here at the house.    The focus is a little soft and I like a soft focus, but this is a little soft.  The composition is simple and great idea.  Good humor always helps one.  I love the blue back ground and the whole idea.  Just wish the focus was just a little sharper.  PTL</td>', 'He can''t phone home, he is sitting on my shelf here at the house.    The focus is a little soft and I like a soft focus, but this is a little soft.  The composition is simple and great idea.  Good humor always helps one.  I love the blue back ground and the whole idea.  Just wish the focus was just a little sharper.  PTL', '2002-11-23 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157317, 8513, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the color ... but .. do not be upset with me ... I would have like my eyes being able to ''rest somewhere'' ... I am not saying the focus/dof is wrong ... just think that it could serve the shot better. 6. Lionel</td>', 'I like the idea and the color ... but .. do not be upset with me ... I would have like my eyes being able to ''rest somewhere'' ... I am not saying the focus/dof is wrong ... just think that it could serve the shot better. 6. Lionel', '2002-11-24 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157318, 8514, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting.  But need to get the flash off the Cam.  The light is too harsh.  Watch the record needle.</td>', 'Intresting.  But need to get the flash off the Cam.  The light is too harsh.  Watch the record needle.', '2002-11-18 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157319, 8514, 4615, '<td valign="top">See this way you can hear messages from Jim</td>', 'See this way you can hear messages from Jim', '2002-11-18 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157320, 8514, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think a different angle would have helped, as well as a closer crop to eliminate unlevelness.</td>', 'I think a different angle would have helped, as well as a closer crop to eliminate unlevelness.', '2002-11-18 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157321, 8514, 5253, '<td valign="top">Felicidades por la foto, creo que es de las mejores, en serio, te quiero!</td>', 'Felicidades por la foto, creo que es de las mejores, en serio, te quiero!', '2002-11-18 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157322, 8514, 714, '<td valign="top">That is one old sterio. Would like better framing Vote 6 Sonifo .</td>', 'That is one old sterio. Would like better framing Vote 6 Sonifo .', '2002-11-18 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157323, 8514, 4821, '<td valign="top">you''re playing the wrong side of the disc.</td>', 'you''re playing the wrong side of the disc.', '2002-11-18 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157324, 8514, 772, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subjects... there are two issues here that I think really hurt this image... 1 - the flash.  The on cam flash rarely produces good quality and effective lighting for an ''artistic'' image.  2 - the angle.  I think you could have possibly worked a stronger angle on this shot to create some more impact... - setzler</td>', 'I like your choice of subjects... there are two issues here that I think really hurt this image... 1 - the flash.  The on cam flash rarely produces good quality and effective lighting for an ''artistic'' image.  2 - the angle.  I think you could have possibly worked a stronger angle on this shot to create some more impact... - setzler', '2002-11-18 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157325, 8514, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great composition.  Not bad ight.  Could have been a little lighter near the top.  Good focus and met the challenge real well.  Pretty good, but not perfect.  PTL</td>', 'Great idea and great composition.  Not bad ight.  Could have been a little lighter near the top.  Good focus and met the challenge real well.  Pretty good, but not perfect.  PTL', '2002-11-19 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157326, 8514, 4275, '<td valign="top">Quite possibly the best shot ever taken well done. 10 from the slimharpo machine.</td>', 'Quite possibly the best shot ever taken well done. 10 from the slimharpo machine.', '2002-11-22 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157327, 8516, 656, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail - you''ve got the exposure just right in this, even to the point of showing some of the filament wire.  The focus doesn''t seem to be quite right, though that could be the reflections on the bulb - makes it look slightly blurred unfortunately.  Hard to control those reflections in this case.  Good effort though.</td>', 'Lovely detail - you''ve got the exposure just right in this, even to the point of showing some of the filament wire.  The focus doesn''t seem to be quite right, though that could be the reflections on the bulb - makes it look slightly blurred unfortunately.  Hard to control those reflections in this case.  Good effort though.', '2002-11-18 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157328, 8516, 4267, '<td valign="top">I would like this more if the focus was a bit sharper... but I still like it<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'I would like this more if the focus was a bit sharper... but I still like it~anachronite', '2002-11-18 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157329, 8516, 4985, '<td valign="top">I like this. The amber color is so warm. I''d like to know how you did this.</td>', 'I like this. The amber color is so warm. I''d like to know how you did this.', '2002-11-19 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157330, 8516, 2752, '<td valign="top">very dramatic composition and colors(8)</td>', 'very dramatic composition and colors(8)', '2002-11-20 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157331, 8516, 2488, '<td valign="top">Nicely performed!</td>', 'Nicely performed!', '2002-11-21 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157332, 8516, 4514, '<td valign="top">too bad.  Nice underexposure.  Terrible focus<br/>:-(</td>', 'too bad.  Nice underexposure.  Terrible focus:-(', '2002-11-21 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157333, 8516, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice closeup of a lightbulb, but it looks like the base is more in focus then the bulk of the bulb.</td>', 'nice closeup of a lightbulb, but it looks like the base is more in focus then the bulk of the bulb.', '2002-11-21 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157334, 8516, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot because it seems to be more of a "suggestion" of a light bulb than an actuality.  Has a nice mysterious kind of abstract feel to it.  This is definitely a good example of "less is more".  lhall</td>', 'I like this shot because it seems to be more of a "suggestion" of a light bulb than an actuality.  Has a nice mysterious kind of abstract feel to it.  This is definitely a good example of "less is more".  lhall', '2002-11-24 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157335, 8516, 3279, '<td valign="top">To those of you who commented on the focus, I agree entirely! That''s the trouble with taking the shots on Sunday evening, I spent ages trying to get it right and this was the best shot I managed. <br/><br/>The problem was, I had to tilt the bulb steeply forward, to throw the reflection of the element out of shot. As it was only lit by the bulb itself, dimmed as far as I could, the aperture was wide open and shortened my DOF even more. What I SHOULD have done is switched over to manual and closed down that aperture as far as I could, but of course I came to that conclusion on the Monday!!<br/><br/>Thanks all for your comments and the surprisingly high placing - I shall try and better it for the next challenge!!</td>', 'To those of you who commented on the focus, I agree entirely! That''s the trouble with taking the shots on Sunday evening, I spent ages trying to get it right and this was the best shot I managed. The problem was, I had to tilt the bulb steeply forward, to throw the reflection of the element out of shot. As it was only lit by the bulb itself, dimmed as far as I could, the aperture was wide open and shortened my DOF even more. What I SHOULD have done is switched over to manual and closed down that aperture as far as I could, but of course I came to that conclusion on the Monday!!Thanks all for your comments and the surprisingly high placing - I shall try and better it for the next challenge!!', '2002-11-25 05:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157336, 8517, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is too far off center for my taste.  It looks like an obvious attempt at being "artsy".  The pic is good as is, but better with better framing. - Inspzil</td>', 'This is too far off center for my taste.  It looks like an obvious attempt at being "artsy".  The pic is good as is, but better with better framing. - Inspzil', '2002-11-18 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157337, 8517, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is good shot.  I would like it even better if you had turned the lamp so that the "caution" label didn''t show.</td>', 'This is good shot.  I would like it even better if you had turned the lamp so that the "caution" label didn''t show.', '2002-11-18 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157338, 8517, 656, '<td valign="top">A hard exposure to get right but you''ve made a good attempt.  The very black and very white subjects are at the extremes of what you could get away with and the silver on the bulb seems to have suffered a bit as a result.<br/>It is well composed, and the glow/ halo around the bulb works quite well.  I think I might have preferred it with a shorter exposure, almost to the point of just seeing a glowing filament, perhaps ?</td>', 'A hard exposure to get right but you''ve made a good attempt.  The very black and very white subjects are at the extremes of what you could get away with and the silver on the bulb seems to have suffered a bit as a result.It is well composed, and the glow/ halo around the bulb works quite well.  I think I might have preferred it with a shorter exposure, almost to the point of just seeing a glowing filament, perhaps ?', '2002-11-18 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157339, 8517, 327, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would of helped this shot for me. It''s done well otherwise.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would of helped this shot for me. It''s done well otherwise.', '2002-11-18 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157340, 8517, 4821, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2002-11-18 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157341, 8517, 5202, '<td valign="top">I love the red glowing effect.  How was that done?</td>', 'I love the red glowing effect.  How was that done?', '2002-11-19 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157342, 8517, 1280, '<td valign="top">Right off the bat, I''m glad to see you aren''t afraid to leave some neg space.  Not dead center....good!   Focus is good. Red glow is interesting....wonder how ya got that.   I can''t really see the artistic merit in showing the label.  What does it really add to the image???  But that could be what you meant to focus on.  Anyway,  best of luck in the challenge.  6   Grayce</td>', 'Right off the bat, I''m glad to see you aren''t afraid to leave some neg space.  Not dead center....good!   Focus is good. Red glow is interesting....wonder how ya got that.   I can''t really see the artistic merit in showing the label.  What does it really add to the image???  But that could be what you meant to focus on.  Anyway,  best of luck in the challenge.  6   Grayce', '2002-11-19 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157343, 8517, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Nice dark background,  and the light has a neat little aura.    Jacko.  8</td>', 'I like it.  Nice dark background,  and the light has a neat little aura.    Jacko.  8', '2002-11-20 06:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157344, 8517, 4648, '<td valign="top">Bet this turned out better than you thought it would.  I like it very much.  I love the red glow around the light bulb.  Great idea and good shot.  I don''t particularly like the crop though.  Forget the 1/3 with a straight up and down object such as this.  It is the full height of the pic.  But still a good pic.  PTL</td>', 'Bet this turned out better than you thought it would.  I like it very much.  I love the red glow around the light bulb.  Great idea and good shot.  I don''t particularly like the crop though.  Forget the 1/3 with a straight up and down object such as this.  It is the full height of the pic.  But still a good pic.  PTL', '2002-11-20 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157345, 8517, 4514, '<td valign="top">Good color.  One of the better pictures for this challenge.</td>', 'Good color.  One of the better pictures for this challenge.', '2002-11-20 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157346, 8517, 1255, '<td valign="top">Interesting red glow.  I like the lightbulb idea and the contrast of the pure black background.  The lamp itself is kind of an awkward shape without the shade, but then I''m not sure how else you could easily see the bulb...</td>', 'Interesting red glow.  I like the lightbulb idea and the contrast of the pure black background.  The lamp itself is kind of an awkward shape without the shade, but then I''m not sure how else you could easily see the bulb...', '2002-11-21 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157347, 8517, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.<br/>I like the top right corner of this - the silver screw mount, the bulb and red halo. Possibly even the top bit of the plastic with just the writing on. I''d like to crop it to just include those elements...<br/>The rest of the plastic bit does nothing at all for me although if it has to be included the composition is certainly more interesting than it would have been centred.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Nicely captured.I like the top right corner of this - the silver screw mount, the bulb and red halo. Possibly even the top bit of the plastic with just the writing on. I''d like to crop it to just include those elements...The rest of the plastic bit does nothing at all for me although if it has to be included the composition is certainly more interesting than it would have been centred.6, Kavey', '2002-11-22 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157348, 8517, 4615, '<td valign="top">off-beat but pleasing.  I like the  red halo.</td>', 'off-beat but pleasing.  I like the  red halo.', '2002-11-23 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157349, 8517, 5070, '<td valign="top">Would be much more interesting to show the actual wires inside the bulbs ... as some people did.</td>', 'Would be much more interesting to show the actual wires inside the bulbs ... as some people did.', '2002-11-23 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157350, 8517, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand the low placement of this one. Pay closer attention the the detail of the lighting on the base.</td>', 'Not sure I understand the low placement of this one. Pay closer attention the the detail of the lighting on the base.', '2002-11-25 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157351, 8518, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice overlay, it makes the shot. Good composition. The "D" is distracting but I imagine that there is nothing you could do with it.   DPz</td>', 'Nice overlay, it makes the shot. Good composition. The "D" is distracting but I imagine that there is nothing you could do with it.   DPz', '2002-11-18 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157352, 8518, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, interesting concept. The only thing I would change is using DNA Codons instead of binary... I don''t think too many people would have caught on anyway though. With the binary though, it would have been more effective with a slightly more random looking numebr pattern. Nice concept though, I like the idea.</td>', 'Nice shot, interesting concept. The only thing I would change is using DNA Codons instead of binary... I don''t think too many people would have caught on anyway though. With the binary though, it would have been more effective with a slightly more random looking numebr pattern. Nice concept though, I like the idea.', '2002-11-18 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157353, 8518, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Are the 1s and 0s supposed to indicate binary code?  Perhaps they should have been more random...</td>', 'Nice idea.  Are the 1s and 0s supposed to indicate binary code?  Perhaps they should have been more random...', '2002-11-18 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157354, 8518, 4494, '<td valign="top">Weird, but I like it.</td>', 'Weird, but I like it.', '2002-11-18 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157355, 8518, 3716, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop loosing the 1s and 0s on the edges could be interesting also.  Nice effect/</td>', 'I think a tighter crop loosing the 1s and 0s on the edges could be interesting also.  Nice effect/', '2002-11-18 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157356, 8518, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Kool shot. Nicely done.', '2002-11-18 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157357, 8518, 4821, '<td valign="top">tricky</td>', 'tricky', '2002-11-18 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157358, 8518, 885, '<td valign="top">hey, real x-rays don''t show bone contour like that...do they???</td>', 'hey, real x-rays don''t show bone contour like that...do they???', '2002-11-18 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157359, 8518, 5021, '<td valign="top">That D is very distracting...</td>', 'That D is very distracting...', '2002-11-19 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157360, 8518, 4411, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this in tighter to lose the white edges. Otherwise I love it.</td>', 'I would have cropped this in tighter to lose the white edges. Otherwise I love it.', '2002-11-19 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157361, 8518, 4210, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop might have been in order to lose the excess on the sides. They''re distracting. As well as covering the D so you couldn''t see the binary through it. Very creative, and it has alot of potential!</td>', 'I think a closer crop might have been in order to lose the excess on the sides. They''re distracting. As well as covering the D so you couldn''t see the binary through it. Very creative, and it has alot of potential!', '2002-11-20 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157362, 8518, 4906, '<td valign="top">The D at the bottom ruins the image.A tighter crop would have been better to avoid the bright lines either side. Nice idea though.</td>', 'The D at the bottom ruins the image.A tighter crop would have been better to avoid the bright lines either side. Nice idea though.', '2002-11-20 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157363, 8518, 3936, '<td valign="top">To tell you the truth, I''m kinda non-plussed about this one.  It appears to be a photo of an xray overlaid on a piece of paper with 101010 etc. on it.  Based on that I''m going to vote a 3 here.  If I''m wrong, I''m user ambaker.  Contact me and I''ll revote accordingly.</td>', 'To tell you the truth, I''m kinda non-plussed about this one.  It appears to be a photo of an xray overlaid on a piece of paper with 101010 etc. on it.  Based on that I''m going to vote a 3 here.  If I''m wrong, I''m user ambaker.  Contact me and I''ll revote accordingly.', '2002-11-20 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157364, 8518, 1255, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of binary and X-Ray.  I might have cropped it a bit tighter on the sides to exclude the white, but you probably tried that already and perhaps it didn''t look as good. What''s the significance of the D in the lower left? shedonist</td>', 'Interesting combination of binary and X-Ray.  I might have cropped it a bit tighter on the sides to exclude the white, but you probably tried that already and perhaps it didn''t look as good. What''s the significance of the D in the lower left? shedonist', '2002-11-21 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157365, 8518, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  What''s the D for?  Derecha (right)?.  Nice colours.  Jacko.  I like it..</td>', 'Very interesting.  What''s the D for?  Derecha (right)?.  Nice colours.  Jacko.  I like it..', '2002-11-21 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157366, 8518, 806, '<td valign="top">the numbers showing on the edges (right and left) takes away from this image. would love to see it cropped differently.. otherwise, you have visually succeeded at sending your message.</td>', 'the numbers showing on the edges (right and left) takes away from this image. would love to see it cropped differently.. otherwise, you have visually succeeded at sending your message.', '2002-11-23 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
