(157373, 8520, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- that''s a cool shot!  If that plane is really flying above the building, this is exceptionally well done!</td>', 'Wow -- that''s a cool shot!  If that plane is really flying above the building, this is exceptionally well done!', '2002-11-18 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
