(157375, 8520, 5036, '<td valign="top">nice imagination. great photo too!</td>', 'nice imagination. great photo too!', '2002-11-18 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157376, 8520, 2858, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Tell me you did it without using burst mode! Symmetry can often be a bit boring in a picture but I think it''s the strength of this photo. Great stuff.</td>', 'Fantastic. Tell me you did it without using burst mode! Symmetry can often be a bit boring in a picture but I think it''s the strength of this photo. Great stuff.', '2002-11-18 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157377, 8520, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the "technical" feeling of this shot.  It seems so exact.  The color is a bit odd to me (all the same muted gray), so I am assuming you either meant to do that, or my monitor is off (could very likely be the latter).  10 karmat</td>', 'I love the "technical" feeling of this shot.  It seems so exact.  The color is a bit odd to me (all the same muted gray), so I am assuming you either meant to do that, or my monitor is off (could very likely be the latter).  10 karmat', '2002-11-18 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
