(157391, 8520, 4210, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ll admit it took me a second of "Okay, how on earth did (s)he catch the plane at that perfect moment, and in that perfect symetry?" Too early in the morning I suppose. I really like the colour, and the photo really grabs the veiwer. Excellent.</td>', 'Okay, I''ll admit it took me a second of "Okay, how on earth did (s)he catch the plane at that perfect moment, and in that perfect symetry?" Too early in the morning I suppose. I really like the colour, and the photo really grabs the veiwer. Excellent.', '2002-11-20 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157392, 8520, 3936, '<td valign="top">This is either a great shot of a plane mounted at the top of the building, or you are one lucky photographer.  I suspect the former, but the pic seems to show spinning propellors.  Either way, an excellent picture. 9</td>', 'This is either a great shot of a plane mounted at the top of the building, or you are one lucky photographer.  I suspect the former, but the pic seems to show spinning propellors.  Either way, an excellent picture. 9', '2002-11-20 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157393, 8520, 3575, '<td valign="top">Perfectly executed! If I find out later that this plane was flying over and not actually affixed to the building I think I will roll over and die of shear adulation. (Hope it''s affixed :)) 10</td>', 'Perfectly executed! If I find out later that this plane was flying over and not actually affixed to the building I think I will roll over and die of shear adulation. (Hope it''s affixed :)) 10', '2002-11-20 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157394, 8520, 4514, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Was this plane attached to the tower or was it actually flying over?</td>', 'Really nice.  Was this plane attached to the tower or was it actually flying over?', '2002-11-20 22:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157395, 8520, 4648, '<td valign="top">This was a 1st place shot.  Wish you had not cropped it this tight, or used a wide angle lens if you had too.  the angle of the shot is awesome.  Good light, good focus, great subject matter, good composition with the exception of the tips of the wings.  Love this shot.  Absolutely love it.  It is one of a kind.  Definitely has the "Wow" and pizzaz that grabs you.  With the wings it is my very favorite one ever.  If you have any with the wings e-mail them to me.  Still worth a 9 but should have been a 10.  PTL  Keep coming back to it and what the heck it deserves the 10 in spite of my little pettiness.  Great job beautifully done.  You deserve the 10.</td>', 'This was a 1st place shot.  Wish you had not cropped it this tight, or used a wide angle lens if you had too.  the angle of the shot is awesome.  Good light, good focus, great subject matter, good composition with the exception of the tips of the wings.  Love this shot.  Absolutely love it.  It is one of a kind.  Definitely has the "Wow" and pizzaz that grabs you.  With the wings it is my very favorite one ever.  If you have any with the wings e-mail them to me.  Still worth a 9 but should have been a 10.  PTL  Keep coming back to it and what the heck it deserves the 10 in spite of my little pettiness.  Great job beautifully done.  You deserve the 10.', '2002-11-21 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157396, 8520, 2978, '<td valign="top">good shot. What a perfect symmetry. Just a bit more contrasst for me would be fantastic. Good luck</td>', 'good shot. What a perfect symmetry. Just a bit more contrasst for me would be fantastic. Good luck', '2002-11-22 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157397, 8520, 5121, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear image. Excellent!</td>', 'Crisp and clear image. Excellent!', '2002-11-22 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
