(157406, 8520, 4648, '<td valign="top">You had me.  I still want to see the whole plane but it is wonderful.  Congratulations.  You deserved 1st - especially by fooling us.PTL</td>', 'You had me.  I still want to see the whole plane but it is wonderful.  Congratulations.  You deserved 1st - especially by fooling us.PTL', '2002-11-25 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157407, 8520, 2780, '<td valign="top">I was had too... doh!<br/>Anyway, great shot!<br/>Congrats on 1st place.</td>', 'I was had too... doh!Anyway, great shot!Congrats on 1st place.', '2002-11-25 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157408, 8520, 4005, '<td valign="top">GRATULATION zum Ersten!!!<br/>Wirklich verdient! Schade, ich konnte letzte woche nicht voten - wär aber eine glatte 10 mit bienchen geworden!<br/>...nicht nur deine freundin wird manchmal grün vor neid...;o)<br/>Liebe grüße - martina.</td>', 'GRATULATION zum Ersten!!!Wirklich verdient! Schade, ich konnte letzte woche nicht voten - wär aber eine glatte 10 mit bienchen geworden!...nicht nur deine freundin wird manchmal grün vor neid...;o)Liebe grüße - martina.', '2002-11-25 04:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157409, 8520, 2221, '<td valign="top">My brother (nds) asked me to tell you that he''s out of town until wednesday and won''t be able to thank you personally. He''ll do that as soon as he arrives. But I think I don''t say something wrong when telling you that he''s very very happy :-)</td>', 'My brother (nds) asked me to tell you that he''s out of town until wednesday and won''t be able to thank you personally. He''ll do that as soon as he arrives. But I think I don''t say something wrong when telling you that he''s very very happy :-)', '2002-11-25 05:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157410, 8520, 2361, '<td valign="top">I looked at this pic several times but it never once occured to me that the plane was attached to the building!  Brilliant, and a well-deserved first place.</td>', 'I looked at this pic several times but it never once occured to me that the plane was attached to the building!  Brilliant, and a well-deserved first place.', '2002-11-25 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
