(157422, 8521, 3540, '<td valign="top">This appears to not have been taken very sharp and sharpened in PS.  That might not be all true, but the effect is the same.  It makes the picture look sort of fuzzy and sort of fake, when obviously it isn''t fake.  Blue makes for a nice background on here and the lighting is good. - Inspzil</td>', 'This appears to not have been taken very sharp and sharpened in PS.  That might not be all true, but the effect is the same.  It makes the picture look sort of fuzzy and sort of fake, when obviously it isn''t fake.  Blue makes for a nice background on here and the lighting is good. - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157423, 8521, 3859, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Looks to be sharpened a bit much.</td>', 'Good idea.  Looks to be sharpened a bit much.', '2002-11-20 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157424, 8521, 1280, '<td valign="top">This certainly meets the challenge and the color is good.  The perspective makes the picture appear flat though.  Side lighting would show some dimension, with light and shadows.  5 Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce</td>', 'This certainly meets the challenge and the color is good.  The perspective makes the picture appear flat though.  Side lighting would show some dimension, with light and shadows.  5 Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce', '2002-11-20 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
