(157440, 8524, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool phone with the little lights..not sure I''ve seen that before. I like the woman and that we don''t really see her. The white window..&amp;lt;?&amp;gt;..on the right could of been cropped out. Job well done. Justine</td>', 'Cool phone with the little lights..not sure I''ve seen that before. I like the woman and that we don''t really see her. The white window..&lt;?&gt;..on the right could of been cropped out. Job well done. Justine', '2002-11-18 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157441, 8524, 772, '<td valign="top">technology, yes... you have caputred ''technology'' in this photo.  What sets a great photo apart from a ''good'' photo is some special quality or ''artistic'' touch.  This photo has an interesting compisition for sure, but there is just something missing from it... I belive the focus is slightly soft here.  Sharpening this one up a tad would definitely make it more appealing in my eyes... also, maybe a slight rotation of her head towards the camera where I could see an eye... the door window in the background is also a slight distraction since it creates a fairly strong irrelevant contrast in the image... This particular image has the beginning of a very nice shot... - setzler</td>', 'technology, yes... you have caputred ''technology'' in this photo.  What sets a great photo apart from a ''good'' photo is some special quality or ''artistic'' touch.  This photo has an interesting compisition for sure, but there is just something missing from it... I belive the focus is slightly soft here.  Sharpening this one up a tad would definitely make it more appealing in my eyes... also, maybe a slight rotation of her head towards the camera where I could see an eye... the door window in the background is also a slight distraction since it creates a fairly strong irrelevant contrast in the image... This particular image has the beginning of a very nice shot... - setzler', '2002-11-18 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
