(157509, 8530, 3859, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great contrast in architecture.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great contrast in architecture.', '2002-11-20 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157510, 8530, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not that bad an idea.</td>', 'Not that bad an idea.', '2002-11-20 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157511, 8530, 2752, '<td valign="top">good use of old refected in the new..</td>', 'good use of old refected in the new..', '2002-11-20 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157512, 8530, 5121, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Very similar to what I had in mind before it got disqualified (I was silly enough not to have read the rules properly and gave it a border!)  Great minds think alike, huh?</td>', 'Nicely done.  Very similar to what I had in mind before it got disqualified (I was silly enough not to have read the rules properly and gave it a border!)  Great minds think alike, huh?', '2002-11-22 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157513, 8530, 5149, '<td valign="top">Cool theme very well done. Good image.</td>', 'Cool theme very well done. Good image.', '2002-11-22 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157514, 8531, 4482, '<td valign="top">My father has one of those! Really cool car! Crisp pic too! 6</td>', 'My father has one of those! Really cool car! Crisp pic too! 6', '2002-11-18 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157515, 8531, 4821, '<td valign="top">great car, not so gret image.  Isn''t this a picture of a picture?</td>', 'great car, not so gret image.  Isn''t this a picture of a picture?', '2002-11-18 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157516, 8531, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat display, but it''s a little outside the realm of what I like to see as a photograph... - setzler</td>', 'This is a neat display, but it''s a little outside the realm of what I like to see as a photograph... - setzler', '2002-11-19 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157517, 8531, 2923, '<td valign="top">if this is all it takes to show technology, i don''t get it.  it''s aphoto of a LCD screen.  Might be cute for Toyota''s advertisement, but like the car, it''s useless to me.  1 paganini (i happen to like high power motors myself, i.e. gas guzzlers or turbochargers, off topic...)</td>', 'if this is all it takes to show technology, i don''t get it.  it''s aphoto of a LCD screen.  Might be cute for Toyota''s advertisement, but like the car, it''s useless to me.  1 paganini (i happen to like high power motors myself, i.e. gas guzzlers or turbochargers, off topic...)', '2002-11-20 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157518, 8531, 2716, '<td valign="top">Good renderng.  Shold tilt the picture to the right to make it straight.  Jacko.  7</td>', 'Good renderng.  Shold tilt the picture to the right to make it straight.  Jacko.  7', '2002-11-20 06:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157519, 8531, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear.  Intresting.</td>', 'Nice and clear.  Intresting.', '2002-11-21 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157520, 8531, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ve been considering getting one of these -- like it? Looks more like a Star Trek display doesn''t it.</td>', 'I''ve been considering getting one of these -- like it? Looks more like a Star Trek display doesn''t it.', '2002-11-23 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157521, 8531, 5070, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s interesting technology.</td>', 'Now, that''s interesting technology.', '2002-11-23 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157522, 8531, 4648, '<td valign="top">Definitely recent technology.  Good clear and well focused shot.  This is the second with the outside temperature in the low 50''s.  Where are you all.  It''s freezing here.  Has good technical photo qualities but lacks "wow".  Doesn''t have an interest getter - unless that it''s from the hybrid car.  But that''s not enough.  Still a real decent photo.  PTL</td>', 'Definitely recent technology.  Good clear and well focused shot.  This is the second with the outside temperature in the low 50''s.  Where are you all.  It''s freezing here.  Has good technical photo qualities but lacks "wow".  Doesn''t have an interest getter - unless that it''s from the hybrid car.  But that''s not enough.  Still a real decent photo.  PTL', '2002-11-23 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157523, 8531, 3161, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments - I know this was a bit of a cop-out as a photograph - not very creative, but to me it represents worthwhile technology, the future ... I am very happy with my Toyota Prius - it suits the type of town/city driving I do mostly. We were having an "indian summer", a warm spell in late Fall in New England, hence the temperature.</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments - I know this was a bit of a cop-out as a photograph - not very creative, but to me it represents worthwhile technology, the future ... I am very happy with my Toyota Prius - it suits the type of town/city driving I do mostly. We were having an "indian summer", a warm spell in late Fall in New England, hence the temperature.', '2002-11-25 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(157524, 8532, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and title. DPz</td>', 'Nice shot and title. DPz', '2002-11-18 00:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157525, 8532, 674, '<td valign="top">Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast. 6<br/>Good composition.  7<br/>Tells a story or creates a mood <br/>      Impact to the viewer <br/>Relevance to the Challenge 10<br/>Overall 7<br/>sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast. 6Good composition.  7Tells a story or creates a mood       Impact to the viewer Relevance to the Challenge 10Overall 7sulamk', '2002-11-18 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157526, 8532, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think it might have been better if we could only see the clock parts and not the out of focus background.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think it might have been better if we could only see the clock parts and not the out of focus background.', '2002-11-18 04:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157527, 8532, 3859, '<td valign="top">Needs a little sharper focus.</td>', 'Needs a little sharper focus.', '2002-11-18 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157528, 8532, 3127, '<td valign="top">Clever title</td>', 'Clever title', '2002-11-18 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157529, 8532, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, and a well-done photo.  The background distracts somewhat, but the color and sharpness of the clock innerds are excellent.</td>', 'Excellent idea, and a well-done photo.  The background distracts somewhat, but the color and sharpness of the clock innerds are excellent.', '2002-11-18 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157530, 8532, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice title, but the lighting could be better.</td>', 'Nice title, but the lighting could be better.', '2002-11-18 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157531, 8532, 4821, '<td valign="top">not enough depth</td>', 'not enough depth', '2002-11-18 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157532, 8532, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  Work with the light and the focal points a little more.  Bring out the depth.  Make it three D<br/></td>', 'Not a bad idea.  Work with the light and the focal points a little more.  Bring out the depth.  Make it three D', '2002-11-20 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157533, 8532, 3540, '<td valign="top">The shallow DOF really isn''t helping this picture at all.   A very small portion of this picture is actually really focused leaving most of the picture slightly out of focus, or more than slightly.  The lighting is not great either.  Good Luck - Inspzil</td>', 'The shallow DOF really isn''t helping this picture at all.   A very small portion of this picture is actually really focused leaving most of the picture slightly out of focus, or more than slightly.  The lighting is not great either.  Good Luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157534, 8532, 4906, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I found the background and reflections distracting. Could have been a bit sharper too.</td>', 'Interesting picture. I found the background and reflections distracting. Could have been a bit sharper too.', '2002-11-20 06:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157535, 8532, 4648, '<td valign="top">You got most of us I bet.  Is this the insides of a clock?  Time machine is right.  Unique idea and well executed.  Decent focus.  Crop a little tight but emphasized what you wanted.  Composition is great.    Light is just a little dark, but not so much to really hurt the shot.  Great photo and one of a kind.  Really like the idea.  PTL</td>', 'You got most of us I bet.  Is this the insides of a clock?  Time machine is right.  Unique idea and well executed.  Decent focus.  Crop a little tight but emphasized what you wanted.  Composition is great.    Light is just a little dark, but not so much to really hurt the shot.  Great photo and one of a kind.  Really like the idea.  PTL', '2002-11-23 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157536, 8532, 806, '<td valign="top">I feel that the vertical lines caused by the item visually separates this image into too many sections. perhaps a slighly different angle to see the mechanics without slicing the image would have helped.</td>', 'I feel that the vertical lines caused by the item visually separates this image into too many sections. perhaps a slighly different angle to see the mechanics without slicing the image would have helped.', '2002-11-23 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157537, 8533, 4625, '<td valign="top">Good shot. nicely done.</td>', 'Good shot. nicely done.', '2002-11-18 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157538, 8533, 1856, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea!!  To me...the girl needed to be surreally perfect (makeup...hair)  to pull this off...i''d love to see this if you ever do more work on the concept. :) Lisa</td>', 'Awesome idea!!  To me...the girl needed to be surreally perfect (makeup...hair)  to pull this off...i''d love to see this if you ever do more work on the concept. :) Lisa', '2002-11-18 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157539, 8533, 4821, '<td valign="top">weird.  Could use greater contrast  Good image</td>', 'weird.  Could use greater contrast  Good image', '2002-11-18 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157540, 8533, 4648, '<td valign="top">Little tood dark.  The eye make up sure doesn''t turn me on.  Would like to be able to see the facial expression more.  Too tight of crop.  But not a bad 5.  PTL</td>', 'Little tood dark.  The eye make up sure doesn''t turn me on.  Would like to be able to see the facial expression more.  Too tight of crop.  But not a bad 5.  PTL', '2002-11-18 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157541, 8533, 4832, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W. Distracting stuff like freckles and water in her hair.</td>', 'Nice use of B&W. Distracting stuff like freckles and water in her hair.', '2002-11-18 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157542, 8533, 2757, '<td valign="top">If more effort would have been taken!</td>', 'If more effort would have been taken!', '2002-11-19 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157543, 8533, 4615, '<td valign="top">What does she have in her hair? interesting B&amp;W</td>', 'What does she have in her hair? interesting B&W', '2002-11-19 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157544, 8533, 4811, '<td valign="top">If you own a graphics editing program capable of doing a levels adjustment, you can fix this image so that it covers a wider range of tones than it currently does. I tried this on my pc and the photo looked really good...</td>', 'If you own a graphics editing program capable of doing a levels adjustment, you can fix this image so that it covers a wider range of tones than it currently does. I tried this on my pc and the photo looked really good...', '2002-11-19 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157545, 8533, 2170, '<td valign="top">Why is it plugged into their mouth?  I think this is an excellent, lovely shot that would have been much better without the plug.  Very crisp and well-lit.</td>', 'Why is it plugged into their mouth?  I think this is an excellent, lovely shot that would have been much better without the plug.  Very crisp and well-lit.', '2002-11-19 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157546, 8533, 1280, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge, interesting perspective and composition.   6 Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce</td>', 'Meets challenge, interesting perspective and composition.   6 Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce', '2002-11-19 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157547, 8533, 4514, '<td valign="top">Ok is she breathing into a breathalizer?  I am lost here.  Plugged in.  What is the point.  Plugged into Technology???</td>', 'Ok is she breathing into a breathalizer?  I am lost here.  Plugged in.  What is the point.  Plugged into Technology???', '2002-11-20 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157548, 8533, 4210, '<td valign="top">I''m confused by the makeup, but otherwise I like it.</td>', 'I''m confused by the makeup, but otherwise I like it.', '2002-11-20 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157549, 8533, 3900, '<td valign="top">OK, now I get it after wondering what she is sucking on for a while.  Sometimes I forget to look at the title.  So, what kind of effect does that give?  Can you feel your ear drums vibrating on your tongue?  Nice concept, but I would like it better if the jack was plugged in to her left nostril. :-)  -7.</td>', 'OK, now I get it after wondering what she is sucking on for a while.  Sometimes I forget to look at the title.  So, what kind of effect does that give?  Can you feel your ear drums vibrating on your tongue?  Nice concept, but I would like it better if the jack was plugged in to her left nostril. :-)  -7.', '2002-11-20 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157550, 8533, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great framing.  Looks like dandruff in the hear, might want to clean that out.  JACKO.  7</td>', 'Great framing.  Looks like dandruff in the hear, might want to clean that out.  JACKO.  7', '2002-11-20 06:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157551, 8533, 4536, '<td valign="top">a bit too grey IMO.</td>', 'a bit too grey IMO.', '2002-11-21 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157552, 8535, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful eye. Good job. Justine</td>', 'Wonderful eye. Good job. Justine', '2002-11-18 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157553, 8535, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  Jacko</td>', 'Nice colours.  Jacko', '2002-11-18 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157554, 8535, 2343, '<td valign="top">I like what you did, the colors are great.  What bothers me  is that it''s not framed right on the left side.</td>', 'I like what you did, the colors are great.  What bothers me  is that it''s not framed right on the left side.', '2002-11-18 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157555, 8535, 4906, '<td valign="top">Shame about the cropped message at the bottom. The firework at the top is distracting.</td>', 'Shame about the cropped message at the bottom. The firework at the top is distracting.', '2002-11-20 06:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157556, 8535, 1280, '<td valign="top">Is it Radio City Music Hall?  Nice shot!  Grayce</td>', 'Is it Radio City Music Hall?  Nice shot!  Grayce', '2002-11-20 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157557, 8535, 3936, '<td valign="top">The bottom line of text tends to be distracting.  That having been said, and since you can''t fix such things for this challenge, this is a very well exposed night shot.  All too often these come out as burned out hilites.  A very pretty and powerful graphic print.  Good job!</td>', 'The bottom line of text tends to be distracting.  That having been said, and since you can''t fix such things for this challenge, this is a very well exposed night shot.  All too often these come out as burned out hilites.  A very pretty and powerful graphic print.  Good job!', '2002-11-20 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157558, 8535, 4514, '<td valign="top">Is this the sing in front of Radio City Music Hall.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Is this the sing in front of Radio City Music Hall.  Nice shot.', '2002-11-21 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157559, 8535, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and great composition but too dark.  Good focus with decent crop.  Met the challenge but something is missing.  PTL</td>', 'Nice idea and great composition but too dark.  Good focus with decent crop.  Met the challenge but something is missing.  PTL', '2002-11-23 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157560, 8536, 3575, '<td valign="top">Super!</td>', 'Super!', '2002-11-18 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
