(157605, 8538, 4648, '<td valign="top">Bad title.  Should have been something like....Computers are the greatest thing since sliced bread".  Technically that is about all I can find wrong with this photo.  I love the humore first and almost as important as the rest.  But the color, crop job,  light, subject, composition are right on!  One question....may I have a slice of that bread?  I give you an 8 for it.  PTL  Looked at it again and again and believe it is a 10.  Great job.</td>', 'Bad title.  Should have been something like....Computers are the greatest thing since sliced bread".  Technically that is about all I can find wrong with this photo.  I love the humore first and almost as important as the rest.  But the color, crop job,  light, subject, composition are right on!  One question....may I have a slice of that bread?  I give you an 8 for it.  PTL  Looked at it again and again and believe it is a 10.  Great job.', '2002-11-19 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
