(157751, 8544, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can only assume this is a heart pace maker.  If so, wow.  How is the patient doing?  This is one of a kind for sure.  Meets the challenge well.  Wondering about the crop - not 1/3''s but tight on top, sides, and loose on bottom?  doesn''t really hurt it, just wondered.  Little dark?  Soft focus works for this.  Great shot.  PTL</td>', 'I can only assume this is a heart pace maker.  If so, wow.  How is the patient doing?  This is one of a kind for sure.  Meets the challenge well.  Wondering about the crop - not 1/3''s but tight on top, sides, and loose on bottom?  doesn''t really hurt it, just wondered.  Little dark?  Soft focus works for this.  Great shot.  PTL', '2002-11-19 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157752, 8544, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good technology!  Well taken photo.  I esp. like the fact that this is on a mirror surface, very nice.  Perhaps a tad dark, but not enough to effect your score, IMO.  9 Swash</td>', 'Good technology!  Well taken photo.  I esp. like the fact that this is on a mirror surface, very nice.  Perhaps a tad dark, but not enough to effect your score, IMO.  9 Swash', '2002-11-20 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
