(157761, 8545, 2170, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to say that the reflections were distracting, but then I got the point!  The only technical issue I have with this photo is that the color is somewhat washed out -- not as vibrant as it could be.  Nice idea.</td>', 'At first I was going to say that the reflections were distracting, but then I got the point!  The only technical issue I have with this photo is that the color is somewhat washed out -- not as vibrant as it could be.  Nice idea.', '2002-11-19 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
