(157781, 8547, 4648, '<td valign="top">You got that right.  And they haven''t much improved on the wheel barrow yet either.  And I''m not sure how you could have improved on this shot.  Others will say too much greenery behind, but I really like that.  I especially like the flowers in front.  The two together frame the wheel barrow.  You hit the nail on the head for the challenge.  All this goes together to make one great shot, with some fun thrown in.  Thanks for some fun with the great pic.  PTL  Like this better and better all the time.  So much so I''ll take you from an 8 to a 10.  Great job.  Look at the wheel and the use that wheelbarrow has had.</td>', 'You got that right.  And they haven''t much improved on the wheel barrow yet either.  And I''m not sure how you could have improved on this shot.  Others will say too much greenery behind, but I really like that.  I especially like the flowers in front.  The two together frame the wheel barrow.  You hit the nail on the head for the challenge.  All this goes together to make one great shot, with some fun thrown in.  Thanks for some fun with the great pic.  PTL  Like this better and better all the time.  So much so I''ll take you from an 8 to a 10.  Great job.  Look at the wheel and the use that wheelbarrow has had.', '2002-11-19 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157782, 8547, 4906, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred the wheelbarrow a bit less hidden. I liked the take on the subject though.</td>', 'Would have preferred the wheelbarrow a bit less hidden. I liked the take on the subject though.', '2002-11-20 06:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
