(157786, 8547, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture looks like it might have been sharpened a bit too much.  It may be the ISO too.  It''s a nice bright picture with pretty good colors.  I don''t know if you would''ve been better off making it sepia or black and white to sort of set the mood better.  Its a good idea when trying to convey that sense of pioneers or something similar to the viewers.  Just a post-voting thought - Inspzil</td>', 'This picture looks like it might have been sharpened a bit too much.  It may be the ISO too.  It''s a nice bright picture with pretty good colors.  I don''t know if you would''ve been better off making it sepia or black and white to sort of set the mood better.  Its a good idea when trying to convey that sense of pioneers or something similar to the viewers.  Just a post-voting thought - Inspzil', '2002-11-24 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
