(157832, 8552, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the music and think I hve most of it - a lot on 45''s.  I almost missed the cassette think it ws a concert ticket.  Could have had better execution.  Still nice shot.  PTL</td>', 'I love the music and think I hve most of it - a lot on 45''s.  I almost missed the cassette think it ws a concert ticket.  Could have had better execution.  Still nice shot.  PTL', '2002-11-23 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
