(157855, 8554, 3540, '<td valign="top">Very busy, probably the one reason I''m not real wild about this pic.  I liked the engine ones better - Feliz Navidad - Bob</td>', 'Very busy, probably the one reason I''m not real wild about this pic.  I liked the engine ones better - Feliz Navidad - Bob', '2002-11-23 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157856, 8554, 4648, '<td valign="top">I have my doubts as to you being on the space shuttle so this must be a stage shot somewhere.  It does show technology for sure.  Appears a little crowded but I guess they are..  Light wise, it needs more light in the bottom corner.  Everything just seems to suddenly disappear there.  Focus is good.  Composition is good.  Crop, like I said seems crowded.  Meeting challenge is great.  Overall is a really good shot.  PTL</td>', 'I have my doubts as to you being on the space shuttle so this must be a stage shot somewhere.  It does show technology for sure.  Appears a little crowded but I guess they are..  Light wise, it needs more light in the bottom corner.  Everything just seems to suddenly disappear there.  Focus is good.  Composition is good.  Crop, like I said seems crowded.  Meeting challenge is great.  Overall is a really good shot.  PTL', '2002-11-23 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157857, 8554, 3320, '<td valign="top">Air and space museum ? I thought about going there last sunday. 6. A little too cluttered for my own taste, but good exposition/colours/contrast. Lionel</td>', 'Air and space museum ? I thought about going there last sunday. 6. A little too cluttered for my own taste, but good exposition/colours/contrast. Lionel', '2002-11-24 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
