(157865, 8555, 4648, '<td valign="top">The coke cans do it for me.  I''m drinking one right now as I score these.  Your focus is a tad off overall, but not too bad.  Met the challenge.  composition is good;  Crop is probably exactly as you wanted it and meant it to be.  Subject matter is different yet similar to other while still one of a kind.  Attention getting, like I said the coke cans got me.  Good shot.  PTL</td>', 'The coke cans do it for me.  I''m drinking one right now as I score these.  Your focus is a tad off overall, but not too bad.  Met the challenge.  composition is good;  Crop is probably exactly as you wanted it and meant it to be.  Subject matter is different yet similar to other while still one of a kind.  Attention getting, like I said the coke cans got me.  Good shot.  PTL', '2002-11-23 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
