(157872, 8556, 4648, '<td valign="top">Like the angle of the shot.  Makes for interest.  Beautiful colors.  Good focus.  Little tight in the crop.  Maybe tone down the brightness a notch.  Otherwise overall great shot.  Course this is all personal opinion.  I like it.  PTL</td>', 'Like the angle of the shot.  Makes for interest.  Beautiful colors.  Good focus.  Little tight in the crop.  Maybe tone down the brightness a notch.  Otherwise overall great shot.  Course this is all personal opinion.  I like it.  PTL', '2002-11-20 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
