(157992, 8562, 3540, '<td valign="top">I love the retro-technology pictures.  I was going to do one myself, just it didn''t work out right.  This is a great idea.  The lighting could be better, the DOF could be a little better as well so the focus could be sharper on more of the phone.  I do like the framing.  - Inspzil</td>', 'I love the retro-technology pictures.  I was going to do one myself, just it didn''t work out right.  This is a great idea.  The lighting could be better, the DOF could be a little better as well so the focus could be sharper on more of the phone.  I do like the framing.  - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 05:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
