(158032, 8566, 5106, '<td valign="top">I like anything with a lot of movement.  In this instance i think it''s beatifully composed with great lighting.  Great feel and great texture in the wet cement and cobblestone.  Subtle old and new tech by way of bridge and transportation.  Good job!</td>', 'I like anything with a lot of movement.  In this instance i think it''s beatifully composed with great lighting.  Great feel and great texture in the wet cement and cobblestone.  Subtle old and new tech by way of bridge and transportation.  Good job!', '2002-11-20 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
