(158073, 8575, 4906, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Pity about the reflections in the lens at the bottom, left. Composition isn''t to my liking, but that''s just a personal preference.</td>', 'Interesting image. Pity about the reflections in the lens at the bottom, left. Composition isn''t to my liking, but that''s just a personal preference.', '2002-11-20 06:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
