(158081, 8576, 1829, '<td valign="top">Hey, this looks similar to my hubbys set up.  2 computers for him, 1 puter for me and 1 for the kids ahhhhhhhh.  Looks like we have something in common - and I thought I was the only one.  Overall, a great pic portraying the life of what it''s really like these days with ''home tech.''  Well done. 8 :)</td>', 'Hey, this looks similar to my hubbys set up.  2 computers for him, 1 puter for me and 1 for the kids ahhhhhhhh.  Looks like we have something in common - and I thought I was the only one.  Overall, a great pic portraying the life of what it''s really like these days with ''home tech.''  Well done. 8 :)', '2002-11-18 05:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158082, 8576, 3900, '<td valign="top">No, you are messy!  Clean it up! :-)</td>', 'No, you are messy!  Clean it up! :-)', '2002-11-18 05:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
