(158085, 8576, 2792, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Almost what my desk looks like!  I probably would have taken it from a different perspective though.  Like what you did with the screens.  7 because it made me laugh</td>', 'LOL!  Almost what my desk looks like!  I probably would have taken it from a different perspective though.  Like what you did with the screens.  7 because it made me laugh', '2002-11-18 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
