(158165, 8581, 749, '<td valign="top">Told ya you''d do well ;o) And you only got one comment asking to explain the title! For those that are curious, a ''radome'' is a common term (in military and aviation circles anyway) for what you see in this great photo, and is derived from the abbreviation of ''radar dome''.</td>', 'Told ya you''d do well ;o) And you only got one comment asking to explain the title! For those that are curious, a ''radome'' is a common term (in military and aviation circles anyway) for what you see in this great photo, and is derived from the abbreviation of ''radar dome''.', '2002-11-25 05:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
