(158196, 8585, 2170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done -- and a very good subject.  My favorite of the record album pictures this week.</td>', 'Very nicely done -- and a very good subject.  My favorite of the record album pictures this week.', '2002-11-18 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158197, 8585, 4648, '<td valign="top">I realize your title tells the story but you should have let a little more of the story teller in on the fun.  I hate you cropped off so much of the victrola.  Not many know what the name is much less the machine.  You have to be my age and above to know both of them.  I love this nostalia wise and photo wise other wise.  Be wiser the next time and show a little more.  Have any out takes?  PTL</td>', 'I realize your title tells the story but you should have let a little more of the story teller in on the fun.  I hate you cropped off so much of the victrola.  Not many know what the name is much less the machine.  You have to be my age and above to know both of them.  I love this nostalia wise and photo wise other wise.  Be wiser the next time and show a little more.  Have any out takes?  PTL', '2002-11-19 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158198, 8585, 1280, '<td valign="top">I happen to love antiques, so you''ve captured my attention right off the bat.    I like the subject, but the composition could stand some improvement I think.  The perspective has the round part too centered.  The arm could come from the corner, on an angle and pull the viewer right in to some place other than dead center.  The lighting is nice, but a little more on the record might be nice too.  The coloring is good...very old fashioned to match the subject.<br/>Nice picture...hope my critique helps.  Anyway, best of luck in the challenge.  6 Grayce</td>', 'I happen to love antiques, so you''ve captured my attention right off the bat.    I like the subject, but the composition could stand some improvement I think.  The perspective has the round part too centered.  The arm could come from the corner, on an angle and pull the viewer right in to some place other than dead center.  The lighting is nice, but a little more on the record might be nice too.  The coloring is good...very old fashioned to match the subject.Nice picture...hope my critique helps.  Anyway, best of luck in the challenge.  6 Grayce', '2002-11-19 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158199, 8585, 4906, '<td valign="top">Would have scored better if the lighting wasn''t so harsh. I would have preferred a higher angle too, in order to eliminate some of the black space on the left.</td>', 'Would have scored better if the lighting wasn''t so harsh. I would have preferred a higher angle too, in order to eliminate some of the black space on the left.', '2002-11-20 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
