(158255, 8589, 3859, '<td valign="top">This is a neat idea.  Personally, I think it would look even better with the remotes placed more casually all over the background instead of being lined up.</td>', 'This is a neat idea.  Personally, I think it would look even better with the remotes placed more casually all over the background instead of being lined up.', '2002-11-23 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
