(158258, 8590, 4625, '<td valign="top">Hehe good use of comedy! Good picture quality. Nicely focused. It''d probably look better with a solid color background though. Well done.</td>', 'Hehe good use of comedy! Good picture quality. Nicely focused. It''d probably look better with a solid color background though. Well done.', '2002-11-18 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
