(158277, 8590, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture is a solid 5.  Nothing spectacular, nothing wrong with it.  The title gets 3, just for making me laugh for the past 3 days.  So you''re up to 8, any questions?  Didn''t think so.  Realistically, it isn''t a 5, and maybe it isn''t an 8, but it''s the funniest damn title/picture combination I''ve seen on here.  Thanks for making me laugh. - Inspzil</td>', 'This picture is a solid 5.  Nothing spectacular, nothing wrong with it.  The title gets 3, just for making me laugh for the past 3 days.  So you''re up to 8, any questions?  Didn''t think so.  Realistically, it isn''t a 5, and maybe it isn''t an 8, but it''s the funniest damn title/picture combination I''ve seen on here.  Thanks for making me laugh. - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158278, 8590, 2125, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2002-11-20 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
