(158286, 8591, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute is in!  This is a refreshing change!  I know cute won''t get 1st place but it is in my book in these times of stress we are in in the world.  Wonderful!  PTL</td>', 'Cute is in!  This is a refreshing change!  I know cute won''t get 1st place but it is in my book in these times of stress we are in in the world.  Wonderful!  PTL', '2002-11-19 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
