(158370, 8597, 3730, '<td valign="top">Hi athena...;) I think the idea was great, but you need more sharpness on the image. Also, on a shot like this make sure the monitor is shot at straight on, not on an angle...tthat way you get equal distance on all sides and it doesn''t look crooked. Good luck. 5 zadore</td>', 'Hi athena...;) I think the idea was great, but you need more sharpness on the image. Also, on a shot like this make sure the monitor is shot at straight on, not on an angle...tthat way you get equal distance on all sides and it doesn''t look crooked. Good luck. 5 zadore', '2002-11-18 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
