(158372, 8597, 1005, '<td valign="top">Hi Athena Giles!  I liked your photo for last week.  This is very well done, but.....a few suggestions.  First, log off to retain your anonomous status (your name in the corner, on the other hand, this does demo very good clarity!!!)  Next, square up just a tad to the monitor (but very good to not show refresh lines!!!)  Finally, this is questionable judgement on my part, but I would call this somebody else''s art (the site admins to be specific) and I tend to grade harder for this w/o more personal touches (things that are added to make somebody else''s art more your own version).  All that said, your score will be a 7 from me.  Swash<br/>(So it was an owl''s foot, eh?)</td>', 'Hi Athena Giles!  I liked your photo for last week.  This is very well done, but.....a few suggestions.  First, log off to retain your anonomous status (your name in the corner, on the other hand, this does demo very good clarity!!!)  Next, square up just a tad to the monitor (but very good to not show refresh lines!!!)  Finally, this is questionable judgement on my part, but I would call this somebody else''s art (the site admins to be specific) and I tend to grade harder for this w/o more personal touches (things that are added to make somebody else''s art more your own version).  All that said, your score will be a 7 from me.  Swash(So it was an owl''s foot, eh?)', '2002-11-18 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
