(158405, 8602, 2618, '<td valign="top">Yeah I know, the lighting could really be much better. But it was a bugger to do (the bottom light was a six foot stand lamp lying almost horizontally balanced on my leg!). Not one of my best but that''s what you get for only starting about an hour before the challenge closes!</td>', 'Yeah I know, the lighting could really be much better. But it was a bugger to do (the bottom light was a six foot stand lamp lying almost horizontally balanced on my leg!). Not one of my best but that''s what you get for only starting about an hour before the challenge closes!', '2002-11-25 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
