(158428, 8605, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see you having fun and making great photos at the same time.  I''m thuroughly enjoying the humor this week.  And so far all of them have been great shots.  You may have cropped a little tight - for me anyway.  The focus is soft which I like here.  Makes for a relaxing shot.  You met the challenge real well with both the toy and the circuitry.  Great job.  PTL</td>', 'I''m glad to see you having fun and making great photos at the same time.  I''m thuroughly enjoying the humor this week.  And so far all of them have been great shots.  You may have cropped a little tight - for me anyway.  The focus is soft which I like here.  Makes for a relaxing shot.  You met the challenge real well with both the toy and the circuitry.  Great job.  PTL', '2002-11-21 00:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
