(158445, 8607, 2858, '<td valign="top">The repetition of the red/orange bits and other abstract qualities work really well. Niggles : too much sky at the top? have more of the car, or less? Either way, it''s one of my favourite this week.</td>', 'The repetition of the red/orange bits and other abstract qualities work really well. Niggles : too much sky at the top? have more of the car, or less? Either way, it''s one of my favourite this week.', '2002-11-18 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
