(158447, 8607, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat..love this perspective, and the yellow is yummy!!!!  Wish the left was cropped tighter. Still this is well done. Justine</td>', 'Neat..love this perspective, and the yellow is yummy!!!!  Wish the left was cropped tighter. Still this is well done. Justine', '2002-11-18 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158448, 8607, 4998, '<td valign="top">slower shutter speed to blur the train would''ve been better</td>', 'slower shutter speed to blur the train would''ve been better', '2002-11-18 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158449, 8607, 5202, '<td valign="top">wonderful picture, though i think it might have looked better if you used a focusing point somewhere in the middle of the picture, allowing the closest objects to be slightly out of focus, but then what do i know.  Excellent</td>', 'wonderful picture, though i think it might have looked better if you used a focusing point somewhere in the middle of the picture, allowing the closest objects to be slightly out of focus, but then what do i know.  Excellent', '2002-11-19 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158450, 8607, 2170, '<td valign="top">A good take on the topic with a perfect, cloudless sky to frame it!  I''m not sure about depending so much on the traffic reflectors in the foreground -- it almost detracts from the subject.  But the perspective is excellent, and reminds one of train tracks trailing off over the horizon.  Great composition overall.</td>', 'A good take on the topic with a perfect, cloudless sky to frame it!  I''m not sure about depending so much on the traffic reflectors in the foreground -- it almost detracts from the subject.  But the perspective is excellent, and reminds one of train tracks trailing off over the horizon.  Great composition overall.', '2002-11-19 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158451, 8607, 3575, '<td valign="top">Colors are great! I like the slight blur on the train because it gives it motion.</td>', 'Colors are great! I like the slight blur on the train because it gives it motion.', '2002-11-20 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158452, 8607, 4514, '<td valign="top">Very Good.  Nice Depth.  With the amount of light you had,  you could of sped up the shutter for real stop action.  Extra point for meeting the challenge and This is a good shot but better with faster stop action shutter.</td>', 'Very Good.  Nice Depth.  With the amount of light you had,  you could of sped up the shutter for real stop action.  Extra point for meeting the challenge and This is a good shot but better with faster stop action shutter.', '2002-11-20 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158453, 8607, 4648, '<td valign="top">The colors are fantastic.  Great level shot.  Like how you got down and focused along the yellow raised up markers.  It''s that little extra that makes the difference between a good picture and a great one.  Good job.  Focus a little off on the train but not enought to really hurt.  Your eyes see the crispness of the markers.  Great job well done.  PTL.  Worth a 9 anytime.</td>', 'The colors are fantastic.  Great level shot.  Like how you got down and focused along the yellow raised up markers.  It''s that little extra that makes the difference between a good picture and a great one.  Good job.  Focus a little off on the train but not enought to really hurt.  Your eyes see the crispness of the markers.  Great job well done.  PTL.  Worth a 9 anytime.', '2002-11-21 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158454, 8607, 2989, '<td valign="top">The train is a little blurry, but I love the perspective and choice ofs color inclusion.</td>', 'The train is a little blurry, but I love the perspective and choice ofs color inclusion.', '2002-11-22 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158455, 8607, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I bet people thought you were crazy.  Did you actually get out of your vehicle, or were you able ot hold the camera down some how? karmat</td>', 'Nice shot.  I bet people thought you were crazy.  Did you actually get out of your vehicle, or were you able ot hold the camera down some how? karmat', '2002-11-22 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158456, 8607, 4275, '<td valign="top">Quite possibly the best shot ever taken well done. 10 from the slimharpo machine.</td>', 'Quite possibly the best shot ever taken well done. 10 from the slimharpo machine.', '2002-11-22 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158457, 8607, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great composition, very nice gestalt, especially the yellow reflectors leading up to the train, implying movement.</td>', 'Great composition, very nice gestalt, especially the yellow reflectors leading up to the train, implying movement.', '2002-11-22 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158458, 8607, 671, '<td valign="top">nice composition!</td>', 'nice composition!', '2002-11-22 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158459, 8607, 5105, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture !! Congratulations</td>', 'Nice Picture !! Congratulations', '2002-11-23 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158460, 8607, 4388, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments. Yes I did stand out in the street to get this photo.   A train came by every 8 minutes so I had to wait each time I took a photo.  I waited on the sidewalk and when the crossing signal sounded I had plenty time to get out to the middle of the street.  I had a 6" tripod attached to my camera.  The first several photos didn''t even have a train in the picture it was going by so fast.  Finally got a few with trains in them.  Wish the train itself in this photo was either more or less blurry, but I''m really pleased with the results.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments. Yes I did stand out in the street to get this photo.   A train came by every 8 minutes so I had to wait each time I took a photo.  I waited on the sidewalk and when the crossing signal sounded I had plenty time to get out to the middle of the street.  I had a 6" tripod attached to my camera.  The first several photos didn''t even have a train in the picture it was going by so fast.  Finally got a few with trains in them.  Wish the train itself in this photo was either more or less blurry, but I''m really pleased with the results.', '2002-11-25 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(158461, 8607, 5250, '<td valign="top">I thought that this photo deserved first place in this dpchallenge. It was attention getting, and it gave me a warm feeling with all that yellow. Good Job!</td>', 'I thought that this photo deserved first place in this dpchallenge. It was attention getting, and it gave me a warm feeling with all that yellow. Good Job!', '2002-11-26 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(158462, 8608, 4267, '<td valign="top">love the composition and idea, it just needs better focus.. and maybe a different light angle</td>', 'love the composition and idea, it just needs better focus.. and maybe a different light angle', '2002-11-18 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158463, 8608, 4625, '<td valign="top">a pink background? Image quality could have been a little higher to make it a little sharper, and the focus seems off a bit.</td>', 'a pink background? Image quality could have been a little higher to make it a little sharper, and the focus seems off a bit.', '2002-11-18 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
