(158467, 8608, 3506, '<td valign="top">I would argue that technology only makes "it" easier when the opposing forces don''t possess equal technology.  In other words, it''s a disparity in technology that makes "it" easier for one side.<br/><br/>Anyway, I like your photo idea and layout.  The picture looks slightly overexposed and just a hair out of focus.  The layout and colors are great though.  :)  (7)</td>', 'I would argue that technology only makes "it" easier when the opposing forces don''t possess equal technology.  In other words, it''s a disparity in technology that makes "it" easier for one side.Anyway, I like your photo idea and layout.  The picture looks slightly overexposed and just a hair out of focus.  The layout and colors are great though.  :)  (7)', '2002-11-18 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158468, 8608, 4798, '<td valign="top">Uhm, hopefully you have them on loan...</td>', 'Uhm, hopefully you have them on loan...', '2002-11-18 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
