(158482, 8608, 2488, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately it does!!Great idea,nice shot.You own all theese weapons!!:):):)</td>', 'Unfortunately it does!!Great idea,nice shot.You own all theese weapons!!:):):)', '2002-11-21 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158483, 8608, 4536, '<td valign="top">makes me squint, I think it''s over sharpened and overexposed.<br/>like the progression setup.</td>', 'makes me squint, I think it''s over sharpened and overexposed.like the progression setup.', '2002-11-21 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158484, 8608, 2337, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of background color.  I''m not sure it adds anything for me.  Personally, I would like to see this as a Black&amp;White.  Your message is well presented and that says a lot.  Though I may not agree with your message 100%, I certainly admire your ability to express it... +points :)</td>', 'Interesting choice of background color.  I''m not sure it adds anything for me.  Personally, I would like to see this as a Black&White.  Your message is well presented and that says a lot.  Though I may not agree with your message 100%, I certainly admire your ability to express it... +points :)', '2002-11-21 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158485, 8608, 4517, '<td valign="top">Are these all yours? If so 10 to you.</td>', 'Are these all yours? If so 10 to you.', '2002-11-21 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158486, 8608, 4986, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, maybe work on how the objects are lighted.  Also the bottom right corner could use something to preak the edge.</td>', 'interesting idea, maybe work on how the objects are lighted.  Also the bottom right corner could use something to preak the edge.', '2002-11-21 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158487, 8608, 5322, '<td valign="top">I</td>', 'I', '2002-11-22 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158488, 8608, 4430, '<td valign="top">I''m a little worried about you here!:)  Great idea.  I''m just wondering if a different background color would have made this better.  Seems a bit bright as well.</td>', 'I''m a little worried about you here!:)  Great idea.  I''m just wondering if a different background color would have made this better.  Seems a bit bright as well.', '2002-11-22 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158489, 8608, 5302, '<td valign="top">Simple and to the point</td>', 'Simple and to the point', '2002-11-22 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158490, 8608, 1280, '<td valign="top">I wished it stopped there,  but today''s weapons are so much more complicated.  Great contrast, good color.  Idea meets challenge and executed fine.  Grayce</td>', 'I wished it stopped there,  but today''s weapons are so much more complicated.  Great contrast, good color.  Idea meets challenge and executed fine.  Grayce', '2002-11-23 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158491, 8608, 1031, '<td valign="top">Quite the collection. Maybe needs a big red button in the upper right to complete the continuum...</td>', 'Quite the collection. Maybe needs a big red button in the upper right to complete the continuum...', '2002-11-23 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158492, 8608, 3532, '<td valign="top">I think you sharpened the image a bit too much.</td>', 'I think you sharpened the image a bit too much.', '2002-11-24 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158493, 8608, 3604, '<td valign="top">OK, just for the record, I don''t own all this stuff.  Well, I do own a couple.  Let''s see, found the rock and club, made the spear and the arrow.  The sword is a display type from my days in Okinawa.  The knife and modern pistol are mine while the old pistol and AK-47 are borrowed.  The grenade is one of two dummys I bought to turn into gag gifts.  I learned a lot in this challenge and the most important one was not to oversharpen a 1.3 megapixel image.<br/>Thanks for all the comments.  The only other shot I''ve gotten this many comments on was my Lady in Red shot.</td>', 'OK, just for the record, I don''t own all this stuff.  Well, I do own a couple.  Let''s see, found the rock and club, made the spear and the arrow.  The sword is a display type from my days in Okinawa.  The knife and modern pistol are mine while the old pistol and AK-47 are borrowed.  The grenade is one of two dummys I bought to turn into gag gifts.  I learned a lot in this challenge and the most important one was not to oversharpen a 1.3 megapixel image.Thanks for all the comments.  The only other shot I''ve gotten this many comments on was my Lady in Red shot.', '2002-11-25 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(158494, 8609, 4625, '<td valign="top">Wow it looks so 2 dimensional... weird.</td>', 'Wow it looks so 2 dimensional... weird.', '2002-11-18 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158495, 8609, 4267, '<td valign="top">looks like cropping and resize warped the photo</td>', 'looks like cropping and resize warped the photo', '2002-11-18 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158496, 8609, 4997, '<td valign="top">The perspective on this looks strange.  What type of lens did you use?</td>', 'The perspective on this looks strange.  What type of lens did you use?', '2002-11-18 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158497, 8609, 811, '<td valign="top">this looks like it is distorted to me.  Is it a reflection of the tower? karmat</td>', 'this looks like it is distorted to me.  Is it a reflection of the tower? karmat', '2002-11-18 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158498, 8609, 327, '<td valign="top">The perspective looks funny here....FISH eye lens?? Just seems off some how? No, matter, good idea and that is sure technology.</td>', 'The perspective looks funny here....FISH eye lens?? Just seems off some how? No, matter, good idea and that is sure technology.', '2002-11-18 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158499, 8609, 4585, '<td valign="top">Leaning...inevitable when shooting up at a structure...i heard that somewhere....I do like the subject.</td>', 'Leaning...inevitable when shooting up at a structure...i heard that somewhere....I do like the subject.', '2002-11-18 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158500, 8609, 3084, '<td valign="top">Is this a photograph of a photograph? Morgan?</td>', 'Is this a photograph of a photograph? Morgan?', '2002-11-19 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158501, 8609, 3575, '<td valign="top">Are those little white bit stars? I think this is a great perspect just want it not to be blurred.</td>', 'Are those little white bit stars? I think this is a great perspect just want it not to be blurred.', '2002-11-20 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158502, 8609, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too dark, met the challenge.  Nothing special about this picture.</td>', 'Too dark, met the challenge.  Nothing special about this picture.', '2002-11-20 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158503, 8609, 4615, '<td valign="top">educational, in that it shows how important proper depth of field is.  Looks completely flat.</td>', 'educational, in that it shows how important proper depth of field is.  Looks completely flat.', '2002-11-20 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158504, 8609, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. The photo has a nice mood. I like how the evening (morning?) sun lights the round antennae in the upper left. The focous could bebetter. Somehow the photo looks like you streched it horizontically, but I can be wrong. Overall a very nice photo of technology. -stephan</td>', 'Great lighting. The photo has a nice mood. I like how the evening (morning?) sun lights the round antennae in the upper left. The focous could bebetter. Somehow the photo looks like you streched it horizontically, but I can be wrong. Overall a very nice photo of technology. -stephan', '2002-11-24 08:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158505, 8609, 3459, '<td valign="top">While meeting the challenge, the image is not interesting (to me).  The obvious flatness of the images makes me think that it''s a picture of a photograph, rather than the original, some noise is quiet appearent, and the colours are blend.  A bit of extra space on the right also is a bit disturbing.  All of the above is not ment to put you down, it''s just an opinion; hopefully a helpful one.  Best of luck.</td>', 'While meeting the challenge, the image is not interesting (to me).  The obvious flatness of the images makes me think that it''s a picture of a photograph, rather than the original, some noise is quiet appearent, and the colours are blend.  A bit of extra space on the right also is a bit disturbing.  All of the above is not ment to put you down, it''s just an opinion; hopefully a helpful one.  Best of luck.', '2002-11-24 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158506, 8610, 5036, '<td valign="top">nice subject, pic is a litty blurry though<br/></td>', 'nice subject, pic is a litty blurry though', '2002-11-18 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(158507, 8610, 4388, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the stone background distracts from the total photo<br/></td>', 'I like the idea, but the stone background distracts from the total photo', '2002-11-18 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158508, 8610, 4177, '<td valign="top">Pink. Ick.</td>', 'Pink. Ick.', '2002-11-18 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158509, 8610, 4821, '<td valign="top">plain jane</td>', 'plain jane', '2002-11-18 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158510, 8610, 4998, '<td valign="top">poor lighting, positioning, and quality</td>', 'poor lighting, positioning, and quality', '2002-11-18 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158511, 8610, 4648, '<td valign="top">The back ground a stone fireplace?  It''s a little too dark for the antique camera.  Like the arrangement of the cameras.  Would like to see the antique one better.  It''s hard with it black and the others silver metal.  Maybe lighten the gamma one step.  I like that adjustment in the MGI PhotoSuite a4 I use for photos.  Then use contrast and brightness to bring it back into depth.  Still real good shot and good challenge meeting.  PTL</td>', 'The back ground a stone fireplace?  It''s a little too dark for the antique camera.  Like the arrangement of the cameras.  Would like to see the antique one better.  It''s hard with it black and the others silver metal.  Maybe lighten the gamma one step.  I like that adjustment in the MGI PhotoSuite a4 I use for photos.  Then use contrast and brightness to bring it back into depth.  Still real good shot and good challenge meeting.  PTL', '2002-11-19 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158512, 8610, 4805, '<td valign="top">I wish there was more contrast between the subjects and the background in this one. I''d like to see more of the older camera! It''s by far the most interesting thing here. I also find the pink distracting.</td>', 'I wish there was more contrast between the subjects and the background in this one. I''d like to see more of the older camera! It''s by far the most interesting thing here. I also find the pink distracting.', '2002-11-19 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158513, 8610, 2170, '<td valign="top">A solid color background would be better.  The pink of the base (and the fact that it''s striped) is very distracting.  The two cameras to the left are both leaning, and the straps could be hidden much better.  This would have been a nice subject for the topic, but this is not a well-composed photo.</td>', 'A solid color background would be better.  The pink of the base (and the fact that it''s striped) is very distracting.  The two cameras to the left are both leaning, and the straps could be hidden much better.  This would have been a nice subject for the topic, but this is not a well-composed photo.', '2002-11-19 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158514, 8610, 4906, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but I didn''t like the lighting or composition. May have been better to use a different drape than what looks like a pink table cloth.</td>', 'I like the idea but I didn''t like the lighting or composition. May have been better to use a different drape than what looks like a pink table cloth.', '2002-11-20 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158515, 8610, 3859, '<td valign="top">I think the pink is a bit distracting.  Perhaps a brown cloth close to the color of the stone would complement your cameras rather than distract from them.</td>', 'I think the pink is a bit distracting.  Perhaps a brown cloth close to the color of the stone would complement your cameras rather than distract from them.', '2002-11-20 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158516, 8610, 3575, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept and the three items you have in the photo but the background, the stones and tablecloth are distracting. A nice clean background would have worked better. So, what camera did you take this with -- :)?</td>', 'I really like the concept and the three items you have in the photo but the background, the stones and tablecloth are distracting. A nice clean background would have worked better. So, what camera did you take this with -- :)?', '2002-11-20 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158517, 8610, 2488, '<td valign="top">Background perhaps too dark,but nicley thought of</td>', 'Background perhaps too dark,but nicley thought of', '2002-11-21 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158518, 8610, 4514, '<td valign="top">On cam flash kills this shot.  :-(  Need to soften the light.  Extra point for meeting the challenge.</td>', 'On cam flash kills this shot.  :-(  Need to soften the light.  Extra point for meeting the challenge.', '2002-11-21 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158519, 8610, 671, '<td valign="top">uninteresting composition</td>', 'uninteresting composition', '2002-11-22 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158520, 8611, 3735, '<td valign="top">Nothen beats a Dell</td>', 'Nothen beats a Dell', '2002-11-18 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158521, 8611, 2344, '<td valign="top">Hey get that pencil and paper out of the way! It''s blocking the technology!! j/k.</td>', 'Hey get that pencil and paper out of the way! It''s blocking the technology!! j/k.', '2002-11-18 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158522, 8611, 1856, '<td valign="top">Technically great shot.  Lisa</td>', 'Technically great shot.  Lisa', '2002-11-18 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158523, 8611, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun. God job.</td>', 'Fun. God job.', '2002-11-18 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158524, 8611, 4793, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nice shot..</td>', 'Great idea, nice shot..', '2002-11-18 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158525, 8611, 4648, '<td valign="top">Please lighten the background just a tad, a very small tad.  I love this whole thing.  Good crop, good centering, all around good techs.  Now to see who gets the 2 more points for 1st place.  I needed to laugh this week and you''ve helped a lot.  Thanks.  PTL</td>', 'Please lighten the background just a tad, a very small tad.  I love this whole thing.  Good crop, good centering, all around good techs.  Now to see who gets the 2 more points for 1st place.  I needed to laugh this week and you''ve helped a lot.  Thanks.  PTL', '2002-11-19 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158526, 8611, 3575, '<td valign="top">I like the "then &amp; now" comparison. And your "Dollar Store Computer" tag. I think it image could be sharper and I would have liked to see the whole pencil.</td>', 'I like the "then & now" comparison. And your "Dollar Store Computer" tag. I think it image could be sharper and I would have liked to see the whole pencil.', '2002-11-20 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158527, 8611, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice Dell.  Good pencil.</td>', 'Nice Dell.  Good pencil.', '2002-11-21 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158528, 8611, 1031, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a "executive digital calculator" I came across a few years ago: a polished slab of wood with five -finger-sized holes...</td>', 'This reminds me of a "executive digital calculator" I came across a few years ago: a polished slab of wood with five -finger-sized holes...', '2002-11-23 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158529, 8611, 1652, '<td valign="top">nice setup</td>', 'nice setup', '2002-11-24 22:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158530, 8612, 4821, '<td valign="top">too abstract for my taste</td>', 'too abstract for my taste', '2002-11-18 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158531, 8612, 3738, '<td valign="top">Huh????</td>', 'Huh????', '2002-11-18 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158532, 8612, 772, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you said what this is in the title... I would have had no idea otherwise... i am supportive of the idea that photos for challenges need to stand alone without a title.  They need to convey your message to the viewer, and the title should just be supplemental or enhance the photo in some way.  The title is required for this photo to be understood... - setzler</td>', 'I''m glad you said what this is in the title... I would have had no idea otherwise... i am supportive of the idea that photos for challenges need to stand alone without a title.  They need to convey your message to the viewer, and the title should just be supplemental or enhance the photo in some way.  The title is required for this photo to be understood... - setzler', '2002-11-19 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158533, 8612, 4648, '<td valign="top">Huh?  You''ve lost me.  Sorry.  PTL</td>', 'Huh?  You''ve lost me.  Sorry.  PTL', '2002-11-19 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158534, 8612, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but there needed to be more planning.  I think this picture is old.  many scratches.  How is that a digital picture?  Either that or it is a picture of a picture.</td>', 'Not a bad idea but there needed to be more planning.  I think this picture is old.  many scratches.  How is that a digital picture?  Either that or it is a picture of a picture.', '2002-11-20 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158535, 8612, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a most unusual picture.  I''m not sure I like it.  It''s sort of abstract artsy, but not very interestingly so.  Aside from the framing, I''m not real wild about it.  Sorry - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a most unusual picture.  I''m not sure I like it.  It''s sort of abstract artsy, but not very interestingly so.  Aside from the framing, I''m not real wild about it.  Sorry - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
