(158567, 8617, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is getting to be more fun the further I go.  I love it all and I love this picture.  Beautiful colors, techs, all of it.  Fantastic picture.  PTL  Looked some more at it, and besides the wonderful humor it is such a great pic I added t2 points for a 10.  It deserves it.  Great job</td>', 'This is getting to be more fun the further I go.  I love it all and I love this picture.  Beautiful colors, techs, all of it.  Fantastic picture.  PTL  Looked some more at it, and besides the wonderful humor it is such a great pic I added t2 points for a 10.  It deserves it.  Great job', '2002-11-19 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158568, 8617, 4064, '<td valign="top">I really like the title and it''s a nice idea.  Hard to focus properly I guess with so much so near and so far, but at least the hands are very clear.  I kind of wish it were the leaf instead though.  Not a bad composition, and it''s pretty balanced. 7</td>', 'I really like the title and it''s a nice idea.  Hard to focus properly I guess with so much so near and so far, but at least the hands are very clear.  I kind of wish it were the leaf instead though.  Not a bad composition, and it''s pretty balanced. 7', '2002-11-20 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
