(158580, 8618, 4648, '<td valign="top">I know you knew before you submitted it the flash would catch what for.  So let''s look at the rest of it.  I like the color and the focus.  The close crop works well here.  I love the finger on the button..  Great idea, now if you could figure out getting rid of the flash you''d have a great picture.  I still like it though.  PTL</td>', 'I know you knew before you submitted it the flash would catch what for.  So let''s look at the rest of it.  I like the color and the focus.  The close crop works well here.  I love the finger on the button..  Great idea, now if you could figure out getting rid of the flash you''d have a great picture.  I still like it though.  PTL', '2002-11-20 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158581, 8618, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ouch flash!  (I see stars....)  Hi Joe or Capota!  Lens flare in the lower right corner, too!  Interesting idea, but I''m afraid I just don''t care for the way it turned out.  <br/>6 Swash</td>', 'Ouch flash!  (I see stars....)  Hi Joe or Capota!  Lens flare in the lower right corner, too!  Interesting idea, but I''m afraid I just don''t care for the way it turned out.  6 Swash', '2002-11-20 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
