(158610, 8621, 1143, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is really good. Can''t fault it any. Good tone. This whole challenge seems really cold to me tho. I just haven''t found any pleasing photos that I''d want on my desktop or framed, ya know? Anyway, good idea and execution.  ~indi</td>', 'Technically, this is really good. Can''t fault it any. Good tone. This whole challenge seems really cold to me tho. I just haven''t found any pleasing photos that I''d want on my desktop or framed, ya know? Anyway, good idea and execution.  ~indi', '2002-11-24 01:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
