(158616, 8622, 4648, '<td valign="top">Why in the world di you crop off part of this beautiful machine?  Why?  I don''t care what anyone else says you should not have done it!  That''s my personal opinion.  That lost my 10.  PTL  Thought about it and the crop on corpped off 1 point.</td>', 'Why in the world di you crop off part of this beautiful machine?  Why?  I don''t care what anyone else says you should not have done it!  That''s my personal opinion.  That lost my 10.  PTL  Thought about it and the crop on corpped off 1 point.', '2002-11-19 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158617, 8622, 2866, '<td valign="top">Awsome. -9-</td>', 'Awsome. -9-', '2002-11-19 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158618, 8622, 4811, '<td valign="top">What I really like about the photo is the sepia tone that conveys the typewriter''s antiquity, and the lighting (except perhaps the really dark shadows in certain spots). I think though, that it has lost something compositionally by being shot straight on instead of trying out other viewpoints. Perhaps getting in closer and making it slightly more abstract?</td>', 'What I really like about the photo is the sepia tone that conveys the typewriter''s antiquity, and the lighting (except perhaps the really dark shadows in certain spots). I think though, that it has lost something compositionally by being shot straight on instead of trying out other viewpoints. Perhaps getting in closer and making it slightly more abstract?', '2002-11-19 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158619, 8622, 2858, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting object and the picture has charm. But I wonder whether a full-on, ''portrait''-oriented version of it would provide a more satisfying chunk of three-dimensional space required for a balanced photograph. Just a thought. Very good though.</td>', 'This is a very interesting object and the picture has charm. But I wonder whether a full-on, ''portrait''-oriented version of it would provide a more satisfying chunk of three-dimensional space required for a balanced photograph. Just a thought. Very good though.', '2002-11-20 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158620, 8622, 3936, '<td valign="top">Wish you hadn''t cut the top and bottom off.  Good exposure, nice and sharp.  Otherwise a very good picture. 7</td>', 'Wish you hadn''t cut the top and bottom off.  Good exposure, nice and sharp.  Otherwise a very good picture. 7', '2002-11-20 19:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158621, 8622, 4514, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture.  Good focus.  Black and White moves this typewriter.</td>', 'Wonderful picture.  Good focus.  Black and White moves this typewriter.', '2002-11-21 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158622, 8622, 4817, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I would have chosen a slightly more interesting angle though. 8</td>', 'Lovely. I would have chosen a slightly more interesting angle though. 8', '2002-11-21 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158623, 8622, 3859, '<td valign="top">Wish it wasn''t cropped so tightly. I would have liked to see the whole thing.  Very nice shot, though.</td>', 'Wish it wasn''t cropped so tightly. I would have liked to see the whole thing.  Very nice shot, though.', '2002-11-21 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
