(158656, 8624, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the tones, love the perspective. Job well done. Justine</td>', 'Love the tones, love the perspective. Job well done. Justine', '2002-11-18 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158657, 8624, 4821, '<td valign="top">I wish the three keys closest to me were in focus.  But nice image.</td>', 'I wish the three keys closest to me were in focus.  But nice image.', '2002-11-18 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158658, 8624, 2716, '<td valign="top">yes!  a classic.  I think your choice of black and white is appropriate.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'yes!  a classic.  I think your choice of black and white is appropriate.  Jacko.  8', '2002-11-18 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158659, 8624, 92, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT ! I do wish I could see the first row better.  However ....it has great leading lines, color, DOF and meets the challenge...best of all...it''s so pleasing to the eye. = 9 Shiizzzam</td>', 'This is GREAT ! I do wish I could see the first row better.  However ....it has great leading lines, color, DOF and meets the challenge...best of all...it''s so pleasing to the eye. = 9 Shiizzzam', '2002-11-18 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158660, 8624, 2170, '<td valign="top">I love it!  The grainy aspect really adds to the "tintype" feel of the photo.  Great colorizing and composition.</td>', 'I love it!  The grainy aspect really adds to the "tintype" feel of the photo.  Great colorizing and composition.', '2002-11-19 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158661, 8624, 2752, '<td valign="top">very good composition and good choice of color..good dof.</td>', 'very good composition and good choice of color..good dof.', '2002-11-20 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158662, 8624, 2488, '<td valign="top">What a relic!!</td>', 'What a relic!!', '2002-11-21 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158663, 8624, 4817, '<td valign="top">A bit too sharp and grainy, but otherwise great.</td>', 'A bit too sharp and grainy, but otherwise great.', '2002-11-21 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158664, 8624, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice shot good angle.  Intresting picture.  :-)</td>', 'Nice shot good angle.  Intresting picture.  :-)', '2002-11-21 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158665, 8624, 3859, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2002-11-21 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158666, 8624, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good subject but should have pulled out and let us see more of the old machine.  Great sepia - works well here.  Meets challenge well.  Good focus.  Like I said crop too tight.  Otherwise great pic.  PTL</td>', 'Good subject but should have pulled out and let us see more of the old machine.  Great sepia - works well here.  Meets challenge well.  Good focus.  Like I said crop too tight.  Otherwise great pic.  PTL', '2002-11-21 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158667, 8624, 2182, '<td valign="top">Good subject</td>', 'Good subject', '2002-11-21 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158668, 8624, 4430, '<td valign="top">I really like how this looks like a genuinely old photograph.  I''m glad that it looks grainy, and of course the sepia was an excellent touch.</td>', 'I really like how this looks like a genuinely old photograph.  I''m glad that it looks grainy, and of course the sepia was an excellent touch.', '2002-11-22 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158669, 8624, 5121, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, nice sepia</td>', 'Very good composition, nice sepia', '2002-11-22 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158670, 8624, 5149, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.</td>', 'Neat idea.', '2002-11-22 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158671, 8624, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, interesting composition, and I like the coloring you chose.  Very nice. lhall</td>', 'Cool shot, interesting composition, and I like the coloring you chose.  Very nice. lhall', '2002-11-24 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158672, 8624, 3730, '<td valign="top">The contrast on this one is excellent, the perspective is great, a tad more DOF would have been nicer IMO 9- zadore</td>', 'The contrast on this one is excellent, the perspective is great, a tad more DOF would have been nicer IMO 9- zadore', '2002-11-24 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158673, 8625, 2344, '<td valign="top">Turn the matches a little to either side so you dont crop out the extremities.</td>', 'Turn the matches a little to either side so you dont crop out the extremities.', '2002-11-18 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158674, 8625, 2792, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!  Also has a very interesting title. =-)  I like the blue, just wish there the flame was more orange.  9/10</td>', 'Very nice picture!  Also has a very interesting title. =-)  I like the blue, just wish there the flame was more orange.  9/10', '2002-11-18 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158675, 8625, 4536, '<td valign="top">is this an advertisement for your business? :) LOL.<br/>Great idea, good title. I find myself wondering what the background is.</td>', 'is this an advertisement for your business? :) LOL.Great idea, good title. I find myself wondering what the background is.', '2002-11-18 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158676, 8625, 4055, '<td valign="top">Nice colour(s)! I like it. Good composition. Maybe a little "hard" for my taste but that is probably what you intended - overcontrasted. Could have been great in B&amp;W, Great anyhow. High score from me. /carsten</td>', 'Nice colour(s)! I like it. Good composition. Maybe a little "hard" for my taste but that is probably what you intended - overcontrasted. Could have been great in B&W, Great anyhow. High score from me. /carsten', '2002-11-18 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158677, 8625, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but you should have used an nicer looking book of matches.</td>', 'Very cool, but you should have used an nicer looking book of matches.', '2002-11-18 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158678, 8625, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors, overall nice photo.</td>', 'Very pretty colors, overall nice photo.', '2002-11-18 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158679, 8625, 2716, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Funky background.  Jacko. 7</td>', 'Cute shot.  Funky background.  Jacko. 7', '2002-11-18 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158680, 8625, 4177, '<td valign="top">Ah. The Butcher Shop Steak House. Wonder if I''ve eaten there? Haven''t lived in San Diego for over ten years. (I confess. I needed Google to figure the name out.) Interesting shot in any case.</td>', 'Ah. The Butcher Shop Steak House. Wonder if I''ve eaten there? Haven''t lived in San Diego for over ten years. (I confess. I needed Google to figure the name out.) Interesting shot in any case.', '2002-11-18 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158681, 8625, 4832, '<td valign="top">Is the Butcher Shop Restaurant any good? =)</td>', 'Is the Butcher Shop Restaurant any good? =)', '2002-11-18 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158682, 8625, 4267, '<td valign="top">I like this one... I am wondering if just a slightly shorter shutter speed would let us see more of the match head... that might be kinda cool too.. great focus<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'I like this one... I am wondering if just a slightly shorter shutter speed would let us see more of the match head... that might be kinda cool too.. great focus~anachronite', '2002-11-18 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158683, 8625, 4985, '<td valign="top">Very striking photo. Ha! It really grabs your eye.</td>', 'Very striking photo. Ha! It really grabs your eye.', '2002-11-19 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158684, 8625, 4648, '<td valign="top">I love the subject.  I love the color.  I love the title.  If you can''t dazzle them with brilliance, then baffle them with b--- s---.  Is that all the matches it took to get the timing right?  I''d a used books.  I love it truly.  Great techs, in my opinion.  In my opinion we needed this interruption in all the seriousness and to laugh.  Thanks for the laugh.  I thank you.  PTL  After going through all of them and coming back to this you really do deserve 2 more points up to a 10.  Great job well done.</td>', 'I love the subject.  I love the color.  I love the title.  If you can''t dazzle them with brilliance, then baffle them with b--- s---.  Is that all the matches it took to get the timing right?  I''d a used books.  I love it truly.  Great techs, in my opinion.  In my opinion we needed this interruption in all the seriousness and to laugh.  Thanks for the laugh.  I thank you.  PTL  After going through all of them and coming back to this you really do deserve 2 more points up to a 10.  Great job well done.', '2002-11-19 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158685, 8625, 2170, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the topic.  The swirly background almost frames the matches, but is not too distracting.  Nice idea!</td>', 'Interesting take on the topic.  The swirly background almost frames the matches, but is not too distracting.  Nice idea!', '2002-11-19 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158686, 8625, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting picture.  Speed up the shutter a little to get a great flame.</td>', 'Intresting picture.  Speed up the shutter a little to get a great flame.', '2002-11-20 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158687, 8625, 3900, '<td valign="top">Very cool. 9</td>', 'Very cool. 9', '2002-11-20 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158688, 8625, 1005, '<td valign="top">Striking photo!  (*get it? :)  Well taken, good timing.  9 Swash</td>', 'Striking photo!  (*get it? :)  Well taken, good timing.  9 Swash', '2002-11-20 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158689, 8625, 3540, '<td valign="top">First thing I noticed about this picture was that the matchbok was cut off at top and bottom.  The second thing I noticed was the cool blue colors.  I''m not sure what the stuff in the background is.  If it''s removable I would''ve taken it out.  I like the way the highlight of the flame looks on the cover of the matchbook.  With minor improvements regarding background and framing, this could be a really cool shot. - Inspzil</td>', 'First thing I noticed about this picture was that the matchbok was cut off at top and bottom.  The second thing I noticed was the cool blue colors.  I''m not sure what the stuff in the background is.  If it''s removable I would''ve taken it out.  I like the way the highlight of the flame looks on the cover of the matchbook.  With minor improvements regarding background and framing, this could be a really cool shot. - Inspzil', '2002-11-21 05:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158690, 8625, 5149, '<td valign="top">Neat photo. Excellent job on the exposure to say the least.</td>', 'Neat photo. Excellent job on the exposure to say the least.', '2002-11-22 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158691, 8625, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot and composition..I like the cool look to it eventhough the match is definately hot.</td>', 'great shot and composition..I like the cool look to it eventhough the match is definately hot.', '2002-11-23 20:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158692, 8625, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good composition, great colors. Nice job!  Grayce</td>', 'Good composition, great colors. Nice job!  Grayce', '2002-11-24 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158693, 8625, 734, '<td valign="top">For the few that was currious how this shot was done, and what the blue is.. well here it is.. basicly I took a blue bowl from the kitchen lite the match, dropped the match book into the center of the bowl and took a few macros.... other than that the rest is just my vision of art so thats why the corners are cut off... ok well thats it..</td>', 'For the few that was currious how this shot was done, and what the blue is.. well here it is.. basicly I took a blue bowl from the kitchen lite the match, dropped the match book into the center of the bowl and took a few macros.... other than that the rest is just my vision of art so thats why the corners are cut off... ok well thats it..', '2002-11-25 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(158694, 8627, 4625, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me hungry, nice shot!</td>', 'This picture makes me hungry, nice shot!', '2002-11-18 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158695, 8627, 4267, '<td valign="top">haha, I was going to do the same thing... great minds think alike! good lighting, focus, and composition</td>', 'haha, I was going to do the same thing... great minds think alike! good lighting, focus, and composition', '2002-11-18 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158696, 8627, 4906, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the topic. Good picture. Loaf looks tasty too!</td>', 'A nice take on the topic. Good picture. Loaf looks tasty too!', '2002-11-18 07:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158697, 8627, 2344, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t scream technology. The bread looks good but not technology.</td>', 'This just doesn''t scream technology. The bread looks good but not technology.', '2002-11-18 07:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158698, 8627, 5064, '<td valign="top">You''re making me hungry.  Good lighting on this one.  Good close up.  Knife is a nice touch.  Very "tasteful" ;)</td>', 'You''re making me hungry.  Good lighting on this one.  Good close up.  Knife is a nice touch.  Very "tasteful" ;)', '2002-11-18 12:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158699, 8627, 327, '<td valign="top">Great looking bread. Good photo, creative idea. Well done. Justine</td>', 'Great looking bread. Good photo, creative idea. Well done. Justine', '2002-11-18 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158700, 8627, 4793, '<td valign="top">Yum, looks wonderful, nice idea, good shot. Oh! do you share the recipe? a 9 for this shot.Gallatin</td>', 'Yum, looks wonderful, nice idea, good shot. Oh! do you share the recipe? a 9 for this shot.Gallatin', '2002-11-18 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158701, 8627, 5202, '<td valign="top">I love the reflection of the bread in the blade...  and the bread looks delicious.</td>', 'I love the reflection of the bread in the blade...  and the bread looks delicious.', '2002-11-19 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158702, 8627, 1875, '<td valign="top">that looks REALLY yummy!</td>', 'that looks REALLY yummy!', '2002-11-19 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158703, 8627, 4648, '<td valign="top">You stole my comment to "cutting edge" before I even saw yours.  Darn that looks good enough to take a bite of.  It looks life like.  How much better than life like can you get.  A great photo plus a great laugh at the same time.  Focus, crop, composition, subject - all these are great.  Thanks especially for the laugh.  PTL  After looking at it again and again I feel I short changed you to start.  It does deserve 2 more points for a 10</td>', 'You stole my comment to "cutting edge" before I even saw yours.  Darn that looks good enough to take a bite of.  It looks life like.  How much better than life like can you get.  A great photo plus a great laugh at the same time.  Focus, crop, composition, subject - all these are great.  Thanks especially for the laugh.  PTL  After looking at it again and again I feel I short changed you to start.  It does deserve 2 more points for a 10', '2002-11-19 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158704, 8627, 2866, '<td valign="top">A bit title dependent. -3-</td>', 'A bit title dependent. -3-', '2002-11-19 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158705, 8627, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the technology part is the knife by default.  I believe the subject of the picture should not be this cliche, without illustrating some kind of other technology.  That''s personal preference as much as anything.  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'I''m assuming the technology part is the knife by default.  I believe the subject of the picture should not be this cliche, without illustrating some kind of other technology.  That''s personal preference as much as anything.  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-11-21 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158706, 8627, 5121, '<td valign="top">Great title and picture.  Which reminds me.....lunch time, yum yum!<br/></td>', 'Great title and picture.  Which reminds me.....lunch time, yum yum!', '2002-11-22 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(158707, 8627, 1280, '<td valign="top">This looks good!  Nice job!  Grayce</td>', 'This looks good!  Nice job!  Grayce', '2002-11-24 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158708, 8628, 4906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Could have been a little brighter.</td>', 'Nice shot. Could have been a little brighter.', '2002-11-18 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158709, 8628, 4821, '<td valign="top">dark</td>', 'dark', '2002-11-18 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158710, 8628, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too dark. Very grainy.  you did meet the challenge so you get an extra point.</td>', 'Too dark. Very grainy.  you did meet the challenge so you get an extra point.', '2002-11-20 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158711, 8628, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is almost great.  I love the idea.  I think the only thing that I would do different would be to add a second light source somewhere where it wouldn''t reflect too bad off the bulb, but provide a little glare around the edges of the bulb to define and contrast it from the backdrop so we could more easily determine it''s boundaries.  - Inspzil</td>', 'This is almost great.  I love the idea.  I think the only thing that I would do different would be to add a second light source somewhere where it wouldn''t reflect too bad off the bulb, but provide a little glare around the edges of the bulb to define and contrast it from the backdrop so we could more easily determine it''s boundaries.  - Inspzil', '2002-11-20 04:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158712, 8628, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great subject and great idea.  Good composition with good crop.  Know the idea you were trying to achieve but it needs a little more light so we can see the outline of the bulb.  Could have been a 10.  PTL</td>', 'Great subject and great idea.  Good composition with good crop.  Know the idea you were trying to achieve but it needs a little more light so we can see the outline of the bulb.  Could have been a 10.  PTL', '2002-11-23 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158713, 8628, 5070, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.</td>', 'Excellent photo.', '2002-11-23 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158714, 8629, 1856, '<td valign="top">Love this!  Great compostion and DOF.  9 Lisa</td>', 'Love this!  Great compostion and DOF.  9 Lisa', '2002-11-18 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158715, 8629, 3127, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective!</td>', 'Nice perspective!', '2002-11-18 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158716, 8629, 4267, '<td valign="top">not too shabby... great angle on the shot and good DoF<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'not too shabby... great angle on the shot and good DoF~anachronite', '2002-11-18 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158717, 8629, 4821, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I wish the depth of field was greater though. 7</td>', 'very nice.  I wish the depth of field was greater though. 7', '2002-11-18 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158718, 8629, 4998, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great focus. Lighting could''ve been better if it was directional from the left side of the camera and less from the ceiling. 7</td>', 'Nice shot, great focus. Lighting could''ve been better if it was directional from the left side of the camera and less from the ceiling. 7', '2002-11-18 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158719, 8629, 92, '<td valign="top">Very unique and nicely done.  Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Very unique and nicely done.  Shiiizzzam', '2002-11-18 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158720, 8629, 5202, '<td valign="top">I love the veiwpoint as well as the focusing point</td>', 'I love the veiwpoint as well as the focusing point', '2002-11-19 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158721, 8629, 4210, '<td valign="top">Nice colour</td>', 'Nice colour', '2002-11-20 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158722, 8629, 4514, '<td valign="top">Good shot great idea.  To bad the whole panel is not in focus.</td>', 'Good shot great idea.  To bad the whole panel is not in focus.', '2002-11-21 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158723, 8629, 2752, '<td valign="top">composition is great and the shot is well taken</td>', 'composition is great and the shot is well taken', '2002-11-23 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158724, 8629, 4648, '<td valign="top">Need more clearer dof.  Too much out of focus.  Only 3 knobs in focus and that''s all of the focus.  Sorry   PTL</td>', 'Need more clearer dof.  Too much out of focus.  Only 3 knobs in focus and that''s all of the focus.  Sorry   PTL', '2002-11-23 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158725, 8630, 674, '<td valign="top">Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast. 6<br/>Good composition.  7<br/>Tells a story or creates a mood <br/>      Impact to the viewer <br/>Relevance to the Challenge 7<br/>Overall 7<br/>sulamk<br/></td>', 'Technically correct , exposure, focus, saturation , contrast. 6Good composition.  7Tells a story or creates a mood       Impact to the viewer Relevance to the Challenge 7Overall 7sulamk', '2002-11-18 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158726, 8630, 1255, '<td valign="top">Oh my god!!! Love it, love it, love it!  I have not gotten a chance to vote on 20% yet, but I already know this gets a 10.  Congrats for an awesome capture of what technology does to most of us every day... shedonist 10</td>', 'Oh my god!!! Love it, love it, love it!  I have not gotten a chance to vote on 20% yet, but I already know this gets a 10.  Congrats for an awesome capture of what technology does to most of us every day... shedonist 10', '2002-11-18 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158727, 8630, 4906, '<td valign="top">Strong image. I thought it was slightly too bright at the top, left.</td>', 'Strong image. I thought it was slightly too bright at the top, left.', '2002-11-18 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158728, 8630, 2344, '<td valign="top">Very good idea! The only thing I can suggest is to have the mouse hang up higher to be able to cut out some of the excess arm there because your lighting gets a little uneven up at the top left corner</td>', 'Very good idea! The only thing I can suggest is to have the mouse hang up higher to be able to cut out some of the excess arm there because your lighting gets a little uneven up at the top left corner', '2002-11-18 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158729, 8630, 4055, '<td valign="top">Wow, great idea! Perfect composition. A little "hard" in the contrast for my taste. The white parts become a little outburned, perhaps that is what you want to achieve. Just a matter of taste. But still one of the best this week. Good luck! /carsten</td>', 'Wow, great idea! Perfect composition. A little "hard" in the contrast for my taste. The white parts become a little outburned, perhaps that is what you want to achieve. Just a matter of taste. But still one of the best this week. Good luck! /carsten', '2002-11-18 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158730, 8630, 5083, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo! In my opinion, this is a winner! Great composition, great subject!</td>', 'Wonderful photo! In my opinion, this is a winner! Great composition, great subject!', '2002-11-18 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
