(158758, 8630, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this very much because it has a strong initial impact.  At first, as it was loading I felt disgust, because I am disgusted when people (even animals for that matter) are bound.  Slavery, ughhhhhhhh!  As it continued to load and I saw the whole picture I smiled.  How clever!  A siimple composition with a powerful statement. Excellent!  <br/>Technically:  I like the lighting, especially the way it hits, and highlights the knuckles, accenting the clenched fist. Removing most of the color was a good choice too.  Makes it more...um....stark!  <br/>A stark reality.  A concept well thought out and executed.  Great job!  10  Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'I like this very much because it has a strong initial impact.  At first, as it was loading I felt disgust, because I am disgusted when people (even animals for that matter) are bound.  Slavery, ughhhhhhhh!  As it continued to load and I saw the whole picture I smiled.  How clever!  A siimple composition with a powerful statement. Excellent!  Technically:  I like the lighting, especially the way it hits, and highlights the knuckles, accenting the clenched fist. Removing most of the color was a good choice too.  Makes it more...um....stark!  A stark reality.  A concept well thought out and executed.  Great job!  10  Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-11-24 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
