(158763, 8630, 2170, '<td valign="top">OK, I feel comfortable enough to be able to say this:  I REALLY WANTED A RIBBON *weep!*  But I''m absolutely not complaining...my highest score and finish ever!!  Thank you all SO MUCH for all of the great comments.  They were really a pleasure to read.  I really fuzzed and contrasted the picture quite a bit on purpose -- I know it hurt me, but I know it made for a much better photograph.  You can see the original and some outtakes at //www.relliott.net/dp_technology.asp      ---  All in all, a great week.  I have to give all kinds of props to my big toe which, with the help of my remote, took this picture.  ;)  Now to go dig up my old smurf toys for this week''s challenge.  Thanks again!!  Rob</td>', 'OK, I feel comfortable enough to be able to say this:  I REALLY WANTED A RIBBON *weep!*  But I''m absolutely not complaining...my highest score and finish ever!!  Thank you all SO MUCH for all of the great comments.  They were really a pleasure to read.  I really fuzzed and contrasted the picture quite a bit on purpose -- I know it hurt me, but I know it made for a much better photograph.  You can see the original and some outtakes at //www.relliott.net/dp_technology.asp      ---  All in all, a great week.  I have to give all kinds of props to my big toe which, with the help of my remote, took this picture.  ;)  Now to go dig up my old smurf toys for this week''s challenge.  Thanks again!!  Rob', '2002-11-25 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
