(158812, 8634, 772, '<td valign="top">In the ''technology'' challenge, I expected to see a lot of photos of circuit boards.  Knowing this, I believe that these photos need to be done more creatively in an attempt to make them stand out.  How could you have made this photograph more impactive?  If you are new to the challenge concept, one thing you may consider is ASSUMING that there will be several other photos like yours each week.  In many cases, there are!  With this in mind, you need to create impact....  - setzler</td>', 'In the ''technology'' challenge, I expected to see a lot of photos of circuit boards.  Knowing this, I believe that these photos need to be done more creatively in an attempt to make them stand out.  How could you have made this photograph more impactive?  If you are new to the challenge concept, one thing you may consider is ASSUMING that there will be several other photos like yours each week.  In many cases, there are!  With this in mind, you need to create impact....  - setzler', '2002-11-18 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
