(158885, 8638, 4648, '<td valign="top">A masterpiece.  Is this done in the natural colors.  I hope this is the color it was.  Focus is great, sharpness couldn''t be better, subject and composition os great.  Technically right on.  It has "wow" without being wild in color and subject.  Just the natural beauty of nature and days gone by technology.  This is great.  PTL</td>', 'A masterpiece.  Is this done in the natural colors.  I hope this is the color it was.  Focus is great, sharpness couldn''t be better, subject and composition os great.  Technically right on.  It has "wow" without being wild in color and subject.  Just the natural beauty of nature and days gone by technology.  This is great.  PTL', '2002-11-19 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158886, 8638, 2866, '<td valign="top">Nice.  -7-</td>', 'Nice.  -7-', '2002-11-19 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158887, 8638, 2170, '<td valign="top">The shot of color from the leaves is excellent.</td>', 'The shot of color from the leaves is excellent.', '2002-11-19 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158888, 8638, 5106, '<td valign="top">This is just a very nice picture all around.  Very tranquil and serene late autumn vibe.</td>', 'This is just a very nice picture all around.  Very tranquil and serene late autumn vibe.', '2002-11-20 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158889, 8638, 3936, '<td valign="top">Wish I had a poster of this one.</td>', 'Wish I had a poster of this one.', '2002-11-20 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158890, 8638, 3575, '<td valign="top">What an absolutely beautiful photograph! If it snows where this was taken you have to go back and photograph it again. I love the lone white duck in the picture too.</td>', 'What an absolutely beautiful photograph! If it snows where this was taken you have to go back and photograph it again. I love the lone white duck in the picture too.', '2002-11-20 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158891, 8638, 4514, '<td valign="top">Great Idea only problem is the tree brance in the way.  Does not add to anything but displeasure.</td>', 'Great Idea only problem is the tree brance in the way.  Does not add to anything but displeasure.', '2002-11-20 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158892, 8638, 2488, '<td valign="top">Great photo,congratulations</td>', 'Great photo,congratulations', '2002-11-21 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158893, 8638, 3306, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I love the serenity that you have captured so well. I have given you my best score this week. Great going. Lnede</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I love the serenity that you have captured so well. I have given you my best score this week. Great going. Lnede', '2002-11-21 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158894, 8638, 737, '<td valign="top">Wow, what can I say. Just a great photo. Print it and frame it. A 10 from me. Best of class.<br/>Jim msp</td>', 'Wow, what can I say. Just a great photo. Print it and frame it. A 10 from me. Best of class.Jim msp', '2002-11-21 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158895, 8638, 4430, '<td valign="top">beautifully taken, one of my favorites this week.</td>', 'beautifully taken, one of my favorites this week.', '2002-11-21 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158896, 8638, 5121, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture, reflections.</td>', 'Lovely picture, reflections.', '2002-11-22 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158897, 8638, 5149, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. The calm waters and the leaves add to the calm mood of the picture. Great exposure and composition you took a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Wonderful image. The calm waters and the leaves add to the calm mood of the picture. Great exposure and composition you took a beautiful photo.', '2002-11-22 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158898, 8638, 5070, '<td valign="top">Pefect title -- photo colors to match.</td>', 'Pefect title -- photo colors to match.', '2002-11-23 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158899, 8638, 2752, '<td valign="top">lovely composition..something I could hang on my wall(8)</td>', 'lovely composition..something I could hang on my wall(8)', '2002-11-23 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158900, 8638, 806, '<td valign="top">the branch only obscurrs the view, doesn''t frame or enhance it.. Nice reflections and weather emphasizes the mood.</td>', 'the branch only obscurrs the view, doesn''t frame or enhance it.. Nice reflections and weather emphasizes the mood.', '2002-11-23 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158901, 8638, 2553, '<td valign="top">One of my few 10''s this week, this is a beautiful shot.  Very high impact emotionally for me, and there is not a single thing I would change about this shot.  lhall</td>', 'One of my few 10''s this week, this is a beautiful shot.  Very high impact emotionally for me, and there is not a single thing I would change about this shot.  lhall', '2002-11-24 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158902, 8638, 4269, '<td valign="top">Beautiful with lots of depth</td>', 'Beautiful with lots of depth', '2002-11-24 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158903, 8638, 3730, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I really like the composition. Lighing is a tad weak, but still nice. Love the mood it creates...hope you took more shots from diff angles...9 zadore</td>', 'Great shot, I really like the composition. Lighing is a tad weak, but still nice. Love the mood it creates...hope you took more shots from diff angles...9 zadore', '2002-11-24 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158904, 8638, 4536, '<td valign="top">nice soft look to that wood. I think a crop of the bottom would be a good idea.</td>', 'nice soft look to that wood. I think a crop of the bottom would be a good idea.', '2002-11-24 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158905, 8638, 5096, '<td valign="top">Great picture and title.  This was high-tech at one time.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Great picture and title.  This was high-tech at one time.  Excellent work.', '2002-11-24 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158906, 8638, 5212, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the wonderfull comments.  This is my first entry for the dpchallenge and I was shocked to see it come in second with all the great competition.  I did very little to this photo, except to crop it a bit, and lighten/sharpen it a bit.  I really don''t don''t like an overmanipulated digi photograph, but that''s kind of just me, as I am primarily interested in outdoor/nature photography so like things as I see them as much as possible. <br/><br/>I took it at dusk as I got to the site late, as I am a real procrastinator; although the grayed light worked out well for me.   I had some other shots without the leaves, that had more of the water wheel reflection, guess I should have used one of those.  Oh well, I am learning.<br/><br/>I took it two days after I got my new Oly c-2100 UZ, and am still learning it.  Again, THANKS, THANKS, THANKS, all comments were well taken.<br/><br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the wonderfull comments.  This is my first entry for the dpchallenge and I was shocked to see it come in second with all the great competition.  I did very little to this photo, except to crop it a bit, and lighten/sharpen it a bit.  I really don''t don''t like an overmanipulated digi photograph, but that''s kind of just me, as I am primarily interested in outdoor/nature photography so like things as I see them as much as possible. I took it at dusk as I got to the site late, as I am a real procrastinator; although the grayed light worked out well for me.   I had some other shots without the leaves, that had more of the water wheel reflection, guess I should have used one of those.  Oh well, I am learning.I took it two days after I got my new Oly c-2100 UZ, and am still learning it.  Again, THANKS, THANKS, THANKS, all comments were well taken.', '2002-11-25 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(158907, 8638, 5121, '<td valign="top">Congrats.</td>', 'Congrats.', '2002-11-25 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(158908, 8639, 4715, '<td valign="top">bright idea!</td>', 'bright idea!', '2002-11-18 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158909, 8639, 4625, '<td valign="top">The colors are great! The negative space is great. The focus is good. Now to be nittpicky the flame should have been centered with teh CD hole, but the candle should be centered too. So you needed a different candle :-P I like this shot though, really nice.</td>', 'The colors are great! The negative space is great. The focus is good. Now to be nittpicky the flame should have been centered with teh CD hole, but the candle should be centered too. So you needed a different candle :-P I like this shot though, really nice.', '2002-11-18 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158910, 8639, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Good depth.  Great color.  My pleasure to rate this. :-)  How many shots did it take and did you try it with a little shorter shutter speed.  <br/>Turbo</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Good depth.  Great color.  My pleasure to rate this. :-)  How many shots did it take and did you try it with a little shorter shutter speed.  Turbo', '2002-11-18 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158911, 8639, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours.  I like the way you have used a candle to reflect the colours.  Neat idea.  8 :)</td>', 'Beautiful colours.  I like the way you have used a candle to reflect the colours.  Neat idea.  8 :)', '2002-11-18 05:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158912, 8639, 4906, '<td valign="top">Wonderful effect.</td>', 'Wonderful effect.', '2002-11-18 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158913, 8639, 2344, '<td valign="top">Ahh!! Finally a cd image I can live with!</td>', 'Ahh!! Finally a cd image I can live with!', '2002-11-18 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158914, 8639, 4997, '<td valign="top">That''s just a cool effect</td>', 'That''s just a cool effect', '2002-11-18 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158915, 8639, 3127, '<td valign="top">nice effect.</td>', 'nice effect.', '2002-11-18 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
