(158923, 8639, 3540, '<td valign="top">Well done.  This strikes me in the more abstract side, but still meets the challenge well.  Striking vivid colors are always a good thing.  Nice job - Inspzil</td>', 'Well done.  This strikes me in the more abstract side, but still meets the challenge well.  Striking vivid colors are always a good thing.  Nice job - Inspzil', '2002-11-19 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158924, 8639, 4985, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lighting. I like the way the colors rise with the heat.</td>', 'Great colors and lighting. I like the way the colors rise with the heat.', '2002-11-19 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158925, 8639, 2343, '<td valign="top">You rock!! Great idea.</td>', 'You rock!! Great idea.', '2002-11-19 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158926, 8639, 4210, '<td valign="top">I would have tried to center the flame just a little more, but this is still a good photo.</td>', 'I would have tried to center the flame just a little more, but this is still a good photo.', '2002-11-20 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158927, 8639, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Prettiest picture in the review!  Very good color!  Dumb suggestion:  landscape mode, closer to the CD and show less of the candle, as not needed.<br/>9 Swash</td>', 'Wow!  Prettiest picture in the review!  Very good color!  Dumb suggestion:  landscape mode, closer to the CD and show less of the candle, as not needed.9 Swash', '2002-11-20 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158928, 8639, 4811, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you got a CD to reflect those colors, but its really nice. Having the candle and CD immersed in blackness really makes the subject stands out. Only thing I can think of that would impprove the shot would be the removal of whatever is behind the CD, (by changing shooting angle, etc.)</td>', 'I don''t know how you got a CD to reflect those colors, but its really nice. Having the candle and CD immersed in blackness really makes the subject stands out. Only thing I can think of that would impprove the shot would be the removal of whatever is behind the CD, (by changing shooting angle, etc.)', '2002-11-20 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158929, 8639, 3087, '<td valign="top">Attractive, unusual, simple, colourful.<br/>8, Kavey</td>', 'Attractive, unusual, simple, colourful.8, Kavey', '2002-11-22 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158930, 8639, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are simply awesome.  I really like how they "frame" the candle.  For some reason, the flame being off-center kinda bothers me.  Maybe because it is so close to being right in the middle.  Great work. karmat</td>', 'The colors in this are simply awesome.  I really like how they "frame" the candle.  For some reason, the flame being off-center kinda bothers me.  Maybe because it is so close to being right in the middle.  Great work. karmat', '2002-11-22 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158931, 8639, 5149, '<td valign="top">That''s cool. Great imagination and skills to match.</td>', 'That''s cool. Great imagination and skills to match.', '2002-11-22 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158932, 8639, 3447, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, and a lovely photograph.    8      JEM</td>', 'Outstanding, and a lovely photograph.    8      JEM', '2002-11-22 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158933, 8639, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea and well executed. The colors are wonderfully bright and saturated,  focus is very good, and the composition is pleasing.  The candle flame is just right, not being too bright, and the glow of the votive is nice too.  You found a simple and unique way to meet the challenge.   Great job and one of my favorites. 10  Good luck!  Grayce</td>', 'Very clever idea and well executed. The colors are wonderfully bright and saturated,  focus is very good, and the composition is pleasing.  The candle flame is just right, not being too bright, and the glow of the votive is nice too.  You found a simple and unique way to meet the challenge.   Great job and one of my favorites. 10  Good luck!  Grayce', '2002-11-22 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158934, 8639, 5105, '<td valign="top">Very good picture !!!</td>', 'Very good picture !!!', '2002-11-23 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158935, 8639, 2667, '<td valign="top">lovely colors! and good luck in the challenge! ~mcmurma</td>', 'lovely colors! and good luck in the challenge! ~mcmurma', '2002-11-23 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158936, 8639, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great try but looks "too forced" for me.  Don''t know anyother way to explain it.  Good technology to get it though.  Nice focus and good crop.  Good subject and composition.  Just can''t explain why it is only a 5.  Sorry  PTL</td>', 'Great try but looks "too forced" for me.  Don''t know anyother way to explain it.  Good technology to get it though.  Nice focus and good crop.  Good subject and composition.  Just can''t explain why it is only a 5.  Sorry  PTL', '2002-11-23 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158937, 8639, 806, '<td valign="top">pretty.</td>', 'pretty.', '2002-11-23 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158938, 8639, 5044, '<td valign="top">Cool effect...</td>', 'Cool effect...', '2002-11-24 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158939, 8640, 3280, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I wish the lamp were just a bit brighter though. DPz</td>', 'Interesting concept. I wish the lamp were just a bit brighter though. DPz', '2002-11-18 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158940, 8640, 4906, '<td valign="top">Picture seems a little dark. I like the composition though.</td>', 'Picture seems a little dark. I like the composition though.', '2002-11-18 06:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158941, 8640, 2344, '<td valign="top">IMO You need more light over on the right side.</td>', 'IMO You need more light over on the right side.', '2002-11-18 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158942, 8640, 3506, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I''d like to see a little more black border on the left though.  (8)</td>', 'Great idea.  I''d like to see a little more black border on the left though.  (8)', '2002-11-18 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158943, 8640, 4055, '<td valign="top">Very nice. One of three favourites this week. Perfect light. Maybe a little tight framed at left. But still high score from me. /carsten</td>', 'Very nice. One of three favourites this week. Perfect light. Maybe a little tight framed at left. But still high score from me. /carsten', '2002-11-18 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158944, 8640, 4494, '<td valign="top">Better lighting would be nice.</td>', 'Better lighting would be nice.', '2002-11-18 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158945, 8640, 4821, '<td valign="top">very clever</td>', 'very clever', '2002-11-18 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158946, 8640, 2170, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Nice setup and well-done.</td>', 'Funny!  Nice setup and well-done.', '2002-11-19 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158947, 8640, 656, '<td valign="top">an interesting juxtaposition of themes, with the old and new.  The lighting isn''t really clear enough to get the whole effect.  Maybe because you used a dark lamp as well as a dark background ?</td>', 'an interesting juxtaposition of themes, with the old and new.  The lighting isn''t really clear enough to get the whole effect.  Maybe because you used a dark lamp as well as a dark background ?', '2002-11-19 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158948, 8640, 92, '<td valign="top">I like the soft lighting this has and the concept is really unique. I would love to know what camera you use and the detail is sharp !</td>', 'I like the soft lighting this has and the concept is really unique. I would love to know what camera you use and the detail is sharp !', '2002-11-19 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158949, 8640, 4648, '<td valign="top">Little dark.  Missing the now.  Wouldn''t know there was supposed to be a now if you hadn''t titled it so.  Bring on more of your subject - light.  Good  focus, mainly need more light.  PTL</td>', 'Little dark.  Missing the now.  Wouldn''t know there was supposed to be a now if you hadn''t titled it so.  Bring on more of your subject - light.  Good  focus, mainly need more light.  PTL', '2002-11-19 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158950, 8640, 2125, '<td valign="top">nice set up 9</td>', 'nice set up 9', '2002-11-21 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158951, 8640, 4514, '<td valign="top">Nice very nice idea.  Increase the shutter spead to avoid the glare and soften up this shot.</td>', 'Nice very nice idea.  Increase the shutter spead to avoid the glare and soften up this shot.', '2002-11-21 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158952, 8640, 3447, '<td valign="top">Concept and photograph brilliantly simple.      7      JEM</td>', 'Concept and photograph brilliantly simple.      7      JEM', '2002-11-22 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158953, 8640, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Dof is right on, lighting is good...no pun...lol  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce</td>', 'Very nice.  Dof is right on, lighting is good...no pun...lol  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce', '2002-11-24 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158954, 8641, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice but a little bit dark. Especially the top left, It needs a bit of pizzaz. Whoops, the kids were playing with the monitor again, I changed my vote!   DPz</td>', 'Nice but a little bit dark. Especially the top left, It needs a bit of pizzaz. Whoops, the kids were playing with the monitor again, I changed my vote!   DPz', '2002-11-18 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158955, 8641, 811, '<td valign="top">The color on this seems a little muted.  Maybe a touch of contrast to give it a little "pop?" karmat</td>', 'The color on this seems a little muted.  Maybe a touch of contrast to give it a little "pop?" karmat', '2002-11-18 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158956, 8641, 4625, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, I don''t know what exactly it is about it that draws me to it, but I really like it. The colors in teh shot balance eachother well, and the neutral tones do it justice. Well done</td>', 'I like this shot, I don''t know what exactly it is about it that draws me to it, but I really like it. The colors in teh shot balance eachother well, and the neutral tones do it justice. Well done', '2002-11-18 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158957, 8641, 3127, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2002-11-18 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158958, 8641, 327, '<td valign="top">Not too many today can work a slide rule. Fine idea.</td>', 'Not too many today can work a slide rule. Fine idea.', '2002-11-18 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158959, 8641, 4832, '<td valign="top">Very grainy. The position of that graph line is very distracting relative to the pencil.</td>', 'Very grainy. The position of that graph line is very distracting relative to the pencil.', '2002-11-18 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158960, 8641, 4648, '<td valign="top">Watch it!  You are making fun of my high school calculator and I haven''t rated this photo yet.  I want to move the pencil and read the book, and put a little light on your slide rule case.  This is one of the more expensive ones.  Take good care of it.  I love the humor you displayed along with your photographic talents.  Both are great.  Tech are really good.  PTL  I thnik my calculator was off the 1st and 2nd times I looked at this.  The 3rd time was a charm.  I was off a tad.  It deserves another point for a 9</td>', 'Watch it!  You are making fun of my high school calculator and I haven''t rated this photo yet.  I want to move the pencil and read the book, and put a little light on your slide rule case.  This is one of the more expensive ones.  Take good care of it.  I love the humor you displayed along with your photographic talents.  Both are great.  Tech are really good.  PTL  I thnik my calculator was off the 1st and 2nd times I looked at this.  The 3rd time was a charm.  I was off a tad.  It deserves another point for a 9', '2002-11-19 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158961, 8641, 2866, '<td valign="top">I should have thought of this. Well done. -8-</td>', 'I should have thought of this. Well done. -8-', '2002-11-19 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158962, 8641, 4514, '<td valign="top">Holy Cow is that a slide rule???</td>', 'Holy Cow is that a slide rule???', '2002-11-20 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158963, 8641, 3882, '<td valign="top">I had a similar idea, but you presented it much better.  Good job!</td>', 'I had a similar idea, but you presented it much better.  Good job!', '2002-11-22 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(158964, 8641, 1031, '<td valign="top">There''s a professor at UC Berkeley with a sliderule collection/"museum". I have a Pickett LogLog one similar to your''s in the "eye-saver" yellow...</td>', 'There''s a professor at UC Berkeley with a sliderule collection/"museum". I have a Pickett LogLog one similar to your''s in the "eye-saver" yellow...', '2002-11-23 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
