(159002, 8646, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen one quite like this.  Interesting and awesome.  Love the color.  Good soft focus is what this needed.  Good job. Good crop.   Love it.  Looks old.  Know how old it is?  PTL</td>', 'I''ve never seen one quite like this.  Interesting and awesome.  Love the color.  Good soft focus is what this needed.  Good job. Good crop.   Love it.  Looks old.  Know how old it is?  PTL', '2002-11-20 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
