(159052, 8648, 472, '<td valign="top">we have built our entire society on these all too fallible machines.  how could this shot be improved?  difficult to say.  i think a shot of a computer screen may not be the most dramatic way to have gone..  but since you did, maybe another small controlled lightsource on the person showing their emotion more clearly?  i give this shot an 8. mag99.</td>', 'we have built our entire society on these all too fallible machines.  how could this shot be improved?  difficult to say.  i think a shot of a computer screen may not be the most dramatic way to have gone..  but since you did, maybe another small controlled lightsource on the person showing their emotion more clearly?  i give this shot an 8. mag99.', '2002-11-18 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
