(159063, 8648, 4648, '<td valign="top">Good idea but needs to be just a little lighter so we can see the frustration of the person better.  That really is as much your subject as the screen.  Great idea just needs a little better execution.  Otherwise decent pic.  PTL  I know you will get as many "light good" as "not light enough".</td>', 'Good idea but needs to be just a little lighter so we can see the frustration of the person better.  That really is as much your subject as the screen.  Great idea just needs a little better execution.  Otherwise decent pic.  PTL  I know you will get as many "light good" as "not light enough".', '2002-11-21 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
