(159072, 8649, 4648, '<td valign="top">Yes.  And thsi is the best photo cropped - for the slr photos after you pick them up at K-Mart.  That''s what I used mine for before digital.  Now it''s obsolete.  Next thing you know we''ll be obsolete.  Great shot.  I like the over all view.  The crop is perfect.  Like where you centered the shot.  Great job.  Real nice techs.  PTL</td>', 'Yes.  And thsi is the best photo cropped - for the slr photos after you pick them up at K-Mart.  That''s what I used mine for before digital.  Now it''s obsolete.  Next thing you know we''ll be obsolete.  Great shot.  I like the over all view.  The crop is perfect.  Like where you centered the shot.  Great job.  Real nice techs.  PTL', '2002-11-19 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
