(159076, 8650, 4625, '<td valign="top">Hmm, was the color changed? The pinkish purplish outlin aroudn the blue doesn''t look so great, if you could have elimiated that it would have turned out a bit better I think.</td>', 'Hmm, was the color changed? The pinkish purplish outlin aroudn the blue doesn''t look so great, if you could have elimiated that it would have turned out a bit better I think.', '2002-11-18 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
