(159078, 8650, 2344, '<td valign="top">Yeah. Shove some boobs in our face. see how well that will work.</td>', 'Yeah. Shove some boobs in our face. see how well that will work.', '2002-11-18 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159079, 8650, 5083, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was hand colored. Then I posted a thread asking if hand coloring was legal and found out it wasn''t. I then asked how a photo like this was possible (not accusing you of hand coloring, just wondering how) and it was explained to me. Great photo! Awesome coloring, creative choice, nice composition! A 9 in my books.</td>', 'At first I thought this was hand colored. Then I posted a thread asking if hand coloring was legal and found out it wasn''t. I then asked how a photo like this was possible (not accusing you of hand coloring, just wondering how) and it was explained to me. Great photo! Awesome coloring, creative choice, nice composition! A 9 in my books.', '2002-11-18 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159080, 8650, 4829, '<td valign="top">Definitely a technological wonder! (no pun intended, ha!) a little bit of color ''bleed'', but well done. -7- CreativeDotCom</td>', 'Definitely a technological wonder! (no pun intended, ha!) a little bit of color ''bleed'', but well done. -7- CreativeDotCom', '2002-11-18 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159081, 8650, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice touch, I like the originality.</td>', 'nice touch, I like the originality.', '2002-11-18 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159082, 8650, 327, '<td valign="top">It was a cool idea, creative work.</td>', 'It was a cool idea, creative work.', '2002-11-18 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159083, 8650, 4998, '<td valign="top">Nice breast, nice bra, dont know how you shot it....but doesnt fit the category of the challenge. 5</td>', 'Nice breast, nice bra, dont know how you shot it....but doesnt fit the category of the challenge. 5', '2002-11-18 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159084, 8650, 4495, '<td valign="top">if this is legal, then the camera is exhibiting some really odd CA or something where the bra hits the, erm, boobies. :)</td>', 'if this is legal, then the camera is exhibiting some really odd CA or something where the bra hits the, erm, boobies. :)', '2002-11-18 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159085, 8650, 4648, '<td valign="top">WHY does someone always have to get something like this in?</td>', 'WHY does someone always have to get something like this in?', '2002-11-19 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159086, 8650, 2170, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, not being able to spot-edit or spot-colorize left quite a jagged line between the color and the b/w.  If there had been a way to soften that a little bit so it wasn''t so harsh, this would have been a much nicer photo.  As it is, it almost looks like the bra is pasted on.</td>', 'Unfortunately, not being able to spot-edit or spot-colorize left quite a jagged line between the color and the b/w.  If there had been a way to soften that a little bit so it wasn''t so harsh, this would have been a much nicer photo.  As it is, it almost looks like the bra is pasted on.', '2002-11-19 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159087, 8650, 2923, '<td valign="top">If this was the Victoria Secret''s challenge, it might be more interesting :)  but it''s better than a normal photo of a CPU, so i''ll give you extra credit.  However, the lighting isn''t that interesting and without the special effect in PS, it wouldn''t be that interesting as an image.  7 paganini</td>', 'If this was the Victoria Secret''s challenge, it might be more interesting :)  but it''s better than a normal photo of a CPU, so i''ll give you extra credit.  However, the lighting isn''t that interesting and without the special effect in PS, it wouldn''t be that interesting as an image.  7 paganini', '2002-11-20 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159088, 8650, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  I like the effect.  Good job at fillin in the whole frame.  You''ll probably get hammered because of a suggestion of nudity, so I''ll give you a 9.  I like it.   jacko</td>', 'Nice colours.  I like the effect.  Good job at fillin in the whole frame.  You''ll probably get hammered because of a suggestion of nudity, so I''ll give you a 9.  I like it.   jacko', '2002-11-20 06:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159089, 8650, 1280, '<td valign="top">Technology?  Are they prosthetic?  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, and assume that the technology is a prosthetic breast for a cancer survivor.  Even though my gut feeling is that it''s not since there is cleavage.  I''m reconsidering now....actually now I see that a bra is a result of technology.  Sorry it took me a moment to make the connection.  <br/>6 Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce</td>', 'Technology?  Are they prosthetic?  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, and assume that the technology is a prosthetic breast for a cancer survivor.  Even though my gut feeling is that it''s not since there is cleavage.  I''m reconsidering now....actually now I see that a bra is a result of technology.  Sorry it took me a moment to make the connection.  6 Good luck in the challenge!  Grayce', '2002-11-20 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159090, 8650, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good, but like I said in my mailing, the purple lines take away from the crisp edges of the bra.  (What no padding!!!  Where''s the va-va-va-boom cleavage! Just kidding!!!)  8 Swash</td>', 'Very good, but like I said in my mailing, the purple lines take away from the crisp edges of the bra.  (What no padding!!!  Where''s the va-va-va-boom cleavage! Just kidding!!!)  8 Swash', '2002-11-20 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159091, 8650, 3936, '<td valign="top">I assume legally means not silicone or padding?  Wink wink nudge nudge.  A well developed, er well exposed, uh... nice filters...  Seriously, there is more technology going into one of these puppies than most people realize.  Good pic. 8</td>', 'I assume legally means not silicone or padding?  Wink wink nudge nudge.  A well developed, er well exposed, uh... nice filters...  Seriously, there is more technology going into one of these puppies than most people realize.  Good pic. 8', '2002-11-20 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159092, 8650, 3084, '<td valign="top">I fail to see the relevance of this image to the subject matter.  But, I also appreciate that sex sells and folks will likely vote this image with good grades.  Do not get me wrong, it is a nice image, but how does it fit (no pun intended)?  Morgan</td>', 'I fail to see the relevance of this image to the subject matter.  But, I also appreciate that sex sells and folks will likely vote this image with good grades.  Do not get me wrong, it is a nice image, but how does it fit (no pun intended)?  Morgan', '2002-11-20 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159093, 8650, 4514, '<td valign="top">No good.  Do not like.</td>', 'No good.  Do not like.', '2002-11-20 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
