(159116, 8653, 5083, '<td valign="top">Love the composition!</td>', 'Love the composition!', '2002-11-18 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159117, 8653, 4177, '<td valign="top">Lighting, composure, focus are great. Unfortunately, it''s kinda b-o-r-i-n-g.</td>', 'Lighting, composure, focus are great. Unfortunately, it''s kinda b-o-r-i-n-g.', '2002-11-18 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159118, 8653, 4832, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, great texture.</td>', 'Great lighting, great texture.', '2002-11-18 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159119, 8653, 92, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo ! The color, lighting and DOF are awesome ! = 10 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'Wonderful photo ! The color, lighting and DOF are awesome ! = 10 Shiiizzzam', '2002-11-18 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159120, 8653, 2752, '<td valign="top">nice lighting in this composition</td>', 'nice lighting in this composition', '2002-11-21 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159121, 8653, 4514, '<td valign="top">Light is too harsh.</td>', 'Light is too harsh.', '2002-11-21 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159122, 8653, 3459, '<td valign="top">A well composed and executed image.  The subject matter is a bit bland for my taste, however this photograph would make a good stock photo, with space for advertisement and excellent tonal range.  Technically, I am impressed by the way the glare was contained.  Overall, an impressive effort, well worth noting.</td>', 'A well composed and executed image.  The subject matter is a bit bland for my taste, however this photograph would make a good stock photo, with space for advertisement and excellent tonal range.  Technically, I am impressed by the way the glare was contained.  Overall, an impressive effort, well worth noting.', '2002-11-24 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159123, 8654, 5251, '<td valign="top">i like the clarity and space of this picture.</td>', 'i like the clarity and space of this picture.', '2002-11-18 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159124, 8654, 5064, '<td valign="top">Is that a sit-in phone booth?</td>', 'Is that a sit-in phone booth?', '2002-11-18 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159125, 8654, 2170, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well-framed.  I wish there was not a shadow in the foreground.</td>', 'Beautiful and well-framed.  I wish there was not a shadow in the foreground.', '2002-11-18 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159126, 8654, 4267, '<td valign="top">great capture!.... funny to see things people do.. I would like it better if it was closer and more focused though<br/>~anachronite</td>', 'great capture!.... funny to see things people do.. I would like it better if it was closer and more focused though~anachronite', '2002-11-18 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159127, 8654, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this....you have a good eye. I just don''t like the shadow, could of been cropped out. Otherwise.......good work, job well done. Justine</td>', 'I like this....you have a good eye. I just don''t like the shadow, could of been cropped out. Otherwise.......good work, job well done. Justine', '2002-11-18 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159128, 8654, 4821, '<td valign="top">great</td>', 'great', '2002-11-18 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159129, 8654, 4832, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, nice pose, could''ve been better.</td>', 'Nice subject, nice pose, could''ve been better.', '2002-11-18 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(159130, 8654, 4648, '<td valign="top">Which? the phone or the seat.  OK shot.  Nothing spactacular.  Tech ok.  Lacks an attention getter.  Trying to get 1/3s cost you a focal point in my opinion.  I need something to look at up close in this type of photo.  Scenery works from this distance but not a shot with a subject.  Not for me anyway.  Sorry.  Just my opinion.  PTL  I do like the phone seat right over the sign.  Very appropriate.  Maybe one more pint as Iook again for a 6.</td>', 'Which? the phone or the seat.  OK shot.  Nothing spactacular.  Tech ok.  Lacks an attention getter.  Trying to get 1/3s cost you a focal point in my opinion.  I need something to look at up close in this type of photo.  Scenery works from this distance but not a shot with a subject.  Not for me anyway.  Sorry.  Just my opinion.  PTL  I do like the phone seat right over the sign.  Very appropriate.  Maybe one more pint as Iook again for a 6.', '2002-11-20 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
