(156992, 8487, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great techs, great photographic skills to go along with a great sense of humor.  I love it.  A little soft but it works here.  Good shot and a great lift to the spirits.  PTL</td>', 'Great techs, great photographic skills to go along with a great sense of humor.  I love it.  A little soft but it works here.  Good shot and a great lift to the spirits.  PTL', '2002-11-19 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
