(156997, 8487, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  Faster shutter speed is a must and move the background light closer for softer appearance.  You want to see all the colors in the flame.  Overall a great idea.  Good thinking.  You get a 6</td>', 'This is a great idea.  Faster shutter speed is a must and move the background light closer for softer appearance.  You want to see all the colors in the flame.  Overall a great idea.  Good thinking.  You get a 6', '2002-11-20 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(156998, 8487, 2716, '<td valign="top">Very creative  Looks a tad grainy and the switch could have been a bit cleaner.  Just being anal retentive because I think this could have been a winner.  I''ll give you a 9 though.  Jacko</td>', 'Very creative  Looks a tad grainy and the switch could have been a bit cleaner.  Just being anal retentive because I think this could have been a winner.  I''ll give you a 9 though.  Jacko', '2002-11-20 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
