(157013, 8490, 4514, '<td valign="top">Too busy.  Way to many focal points for this challenge.  Advice here is get close to the guard rail and really get a good shot of the Dam vertical with The whole Dam in the shot and not to much sky visible.</td>', 'Too busy.  Way to many focal points for this challenge.  Advice here is get close to the guard rail and really get a good shot of the Dam vertical with The whole Dam in the shot and not to much sky visible.', '2002-11-18 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
