(157024, 8490, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and fits theme well. The bird flying into the frame gives us some perspective as to the size of the structure, and the distant mountains make it look even bigger. There''s an overall blue cast to the picture though that could have been corrected.</td>', 'Very nicely composed and fits theme well. The bird flying into the frame gives us some perspective as to the size of the structure, and the distant mountains make it look even bigger. There''s an overall blue cast to the picture though that could have been corrected.', '2002-11-20 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
