(157026, 8490, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great awesome picture.  The bird really adds to it.  Where is this, it is beautiful.  Technically you got it right.  Nice crop, great focus, great composition, wonderful subject matter, good centering of subject matter.  Can really see depth and distance in the picture.  Great job and awesome pic.  Nice 9.  PTL</td>', 'Great awesome picture.  The bird really adds to it.  Where is this, it is beautiful.  Technically you got it right.  Nice crop, great focus, great composition, wonderful subject matter, good centering of subject matter.  Can really see depth and distance in the picture.  Great job and awesome pic.  Nice 9.  PTL', '2002-11-21 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
