(157082, 8496, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe what I''m seeing this time around, but it is very encouraging.  We all need a good laugh about now.  And it''s being done with such technically correctness in focus, cropping, color, composition, subject.  It''s about perfect. Closen enough anyway.  I''m happy with this.  PTL</td>', 'I can''t believe what I''m seeing this time around, but it is very encouraging.  We all need a good laugh about now.  And it''s being done with such technically correctness in focus, cropping, color, composition, subject.  It''s about perfect. Closen enough anyway.  I''m happy with this.  PTL', '2002-11-19 02:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
