(157084, 8496, 1005, '<td valign="top">While this is a fine picture of driftwood, it doesn''t capture my attention well.  I was tempted to do a photo of spear tips or "cobble choppers" myself, but didn''t want to suffer another week of "did not meet the challenge" comments.  This is even more of an obsure reference.  Half of score for braveness to submit this!  5 Swash</td>', 'While this is a fine picture of driftwood, it doesn''t capture my attention well.  I was tempted to do a photo of spear tips or "cobble choppers" myself, but didn''t want to suffer another week of "did not meet the challenge" comments.  This is even more of an obsure reference.  Half of score for braveness to submit this!  5 Swash', '2002-11-20 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
