(157086, 8496, 2858, '<td valign="top">I like the variety of texture annd shape and the composition here. Also, the muted colours and tonal range are excellent. Very good.</td>', 'I like the variety of texture annd shape and the composition here. Also, the muted colours and tonal range are excellent. Very good.', '2002-11-21 05:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(157087, 8496, 1280, '<td valign="top">You''re right of course!  Some may penalize you for being so.........um.......primitive.  Not me.  I like the idea.  In a book of technology sticks and stones should be included.  About this photo, the lighting is a little harsh and makes it look sort of flat, no shadows and highlights.  Side lighting, either earlier or later in the day, when the sun is low in the sky would attain the shadows to give it depth, and the colors would be a little more saturated. There are some russets, and greens, and browns and greys in here.  Less light would bring them out.  <br/>Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce  :-)</td>', 'You''re right of course!  Some may penalize you for being so.........um.......primitive.  Not me.  I like the idea.  In a book of technology sticks and stones should be included.  About this photo, the lighting is a little harsh and makes it look sort of flat, no shadows and highlights.  Side lighting, either earlier or later in the day, when the sun is low in the sky would attain the shadows to give it depth, and the colors would be a little more saturated. There are some russets, and greens, and browns and greys in here.  Less light would bring them out.  Good luck in the challenge.  Grayce  :-)', '2002-11-21 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
