(157668, 8540, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is really terrific!  Turning the camera for the diagonal was a super idea too.  It gives the pic that little extra umph.  The little bit of color in the picture adds to it as well, although I think it could also work in grayscale.  Either way a good shot.  Focus is a little soft in front, it works but I''d like to see it all crisply focused.<br/>8  Grayce</td>', 'This is really terrific!  Turning the camera for the diagonal was a super idea too.  It gives the pic that little extra umph.  The little bit of color in the picture adds to it as well, although I think it could also work in grayscale.  Either way a good shot.  Focus is a little soft in front, it works but I''d like to see it all crisply focused.8  Grayce', '2002-11-19 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
