(157690, 8541, 2553, '<td valign="top">This MAY be a nuclear plant, but THOSE are COOLING TOWERS, and there are MANY other types of plants that use cooling towers, (cooling towers do not =nukes).  I like the composition, and your lighting that day was pretty good.  Also like the steam action - really adds to the interest of the shot.  Good thing they were on the grid.  lhall</td>', 'This MAY be a nuclear plant, but THOSE are COOLING TOWERS, and there are MANY other types of plants that use cooling towers, (cooling towers do not =nukes).  I like the composition, and your lighting that day was pretty good.  Also like the steam action - really adds to the interest of the shot.  Good thing they were on the grid.  lhall', '2002-11-18 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
