(383384, 8474, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the colours of this shot - they are very warm.  The detail is brilliant although the photo almost looks a little too sharp and is bordering on over-exposure in a couple of places.  Having said that, I doubt I could have done a better job on a tricky subject like this.<br/> <br/>I like the closeness of this shot - a lot of people are afraid to crop so tightly, but I think it works really well.  I like your other shot of this music box but I think I prefer this one - and the score reflects that also.</td>', 'I love the colours of this shot - they are very warm.  The detail is brilliant although the photo almost looks a little too sharp and is bordering on over-exposure in a couple of places.  Having said that, I doubt I could have done a better job on a tricky subject like this. I like the closeness of this shot - a lot of people are afraid to crop so tightly, but I think it works really well.  I like your other shot of this music box but I think I prefer this one - and the score reflects that also.', '2003-08-10 20:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
